//@version=6
indicator("NG Entry Assistant v0.8.14", shorttitle="NG Entry v0.8.14", overlay=true, max_labels_count=160, max_lines_count=30)

// ============================================================================
// NG Entry Assistant v0.8.14 — FROZEN ACTIONS + LANE-E FRESHNESS SHADOW STUDY
//
// Lane A/B/C qualification logic preserves the v0.5 legacy core; v0.8.2 retains the operational safety guards:
//   good context -> strong expansion -> first controlled pullback
//   -> trigger -> PAPER BUY -> structural stop -> first R partial -> structural runner -> PAPER SELL
//
// Lane B is a NEW, separately tracked hypothesis:
//   good context -> break above PDH/PWH -> acceptance/retest above that level
//   -> trigger -> PAPER BUY -> structural stop -> first R partial -> structural runner -> PAPER SELL
//
// Lane B exists to test an opportunity family v0.2.1 could not cover.
// It does NOT loosen or rewrite Lane A after seeing winners.
//
// Lane C is a NEW, separately tracked hypothesis:
//   good context -> confirmed high-quality momentum expansion -> immediate
//   continuation through the expansion high WITHOUT requiring a pullback
//   -> PAPER BUY -> structural continuation stop -> first R partial -> structural runner -> PAPER SELL
//
// Lane C exists to test no-pullback momentum moves such as the coverage gap
// observed in forward chart review. It does NOT loosen Lane A or Lane B.
// Lane D adds a controlled Opening Drive / Fast Mover continuation:
//   exceptional day strength + relative strength + abnormal volume + trend
//   -> brief micro-pause -> break of pause high -> PAPER BUY.
//
// v0.8.8 keeps A/B/C/D frozen and hardens the Lane-E late-arrival hypothesis:
//   • Lane E = post-10:30 late-arrival / second-leg re-acceleration. It never
//     replays an old historical BUY. It starts from the first realtime bar seen
//     by this script instance, waits for a NEW controlled pullback/base, and only
//     buys a NEW local continuation trigger formed after that live start.
//   • Lane E now remembers abnormal volume already demonstrated earlier in the
//     CURRENT SESSION. It no longer requires the most recent/current bar to stay
//     >=2x volume after the stock has already proved participation.
//   • Pullback/base volume must be quieter than the remembered session impulse.
//     At the new breakout, renewed volume versus the pullback is recorded as a
//     quality diagnostic, not a hard veto. This matches the practitioner gene:
//     expansion strong -> retracement quieter -> participation returns.
//   • A/B/C/D volume gates remain byte-for-byte logically unchanged. No RSI,
//     MACD, FVG or extra indicator cocktail is added merely because Plus allows it.
//   • The compact 14-row dashboard now shows CURRENT pace and MOVER-QUALIFIED session volume
//     memory separately so a 1.1x current bar cannot hide an earlier 5x impulse.
//   • Session clock selection remains hardened: use wall clock only while timenow
//     is genuinely inside the active candle; otherwise use that bar's close time.
//
// v0.8.6 preserves the frozen A/B/C/D BUY qualification rules while changing only sizing/exit management and dashboard clarity:
//   • BUY/SELL alerts only by default; WATCH/READY/MISSED alert() messages are suppressed by a master switch;
//   • v0.8.9 ACTION HARDENING: BUY requires a confirmed bullish 5m close through the trigger; intrabar wick/touch cannot buy;
//   • v0.8.9 DE-DUP: default maximum one BUY per symbol per day across all lanes; protective SELL remains realtime;
//   • opportunity/watch state still runs internally and remains visible on the dashboard;
//   • account-capital default is ₹5,00,000 with a configurable 15% per-stock cap;
//   • initial risk budget remains ₹500; sizing uses the smaller of risk-size and position-cap-size;
//   • +2R is the first profit-take, not a mandatory full exit; a runner remains when quantity allows;
//   • the runner is protected at breakeven after partial and trails completed-bar structure;
//   • only backup BUY/SELL alertcondition() choices are exposed.
//
// Original opportunity-coverage behavior retained internally:
//   • FAST MOVER informational alerts default ON so strong leaders are surfaced early;
//   • one-shot SETUP READY alerts fire when A/B/C/D becomes armed;
//   • a separate BREAKOUT / WATCH notification surfaces accepted 8-bar breakouts that
//     have context + meaningful volume evidence even when they do not fit a BUY lane;
//   • BREAKOUT / WATCH is informational only. It never creates a paper position;
//   • existing BUY qualification, stop, target, no-chase and one-position rules stay unchanged.
//
// Audited reliability patch:
//   • confirmed WATCH breakouts are allowed even while Fast Mover remains active;
//   • only a same-update FAST MOVER event suppresses the duplicate breakout WATCH;
//   • one-shot state/event guards own de-duplication, so informational alert() calls use
//     alert.freq_all and cannot suppress another valid event later in the same 5m bar;
//   • dashboard colors now distinguish positive RS from Fast-Mover-threshold RS;
//   • volume color explicitly represents the Fast-Mover volume gate;
//   • Lane D blocker now reports every actual impulse requirement instead of saying
//     "qualifying" before range/body/close/current-bar-volume have passed.
//
// v0.8.4 adds diagnostics without changing trade qualification:
//   • optional one-shot alert() pipeline self-test for temporary wiring verification;
//   • named backup BUY/SELL alertcondition() conditions for independent diagnosis;
//   • production BUY/SELL alert() calls remain permanently enabled internally;
//   • no rollback to planned-fill sizing or long MISSED cooldowns.
//
// v0.8.3 keeps the actionable-alert model and preserves v0.5 Lane A/B/C qualification behavior:
//   • actionable BUY/SELL alert code is always ON internally; it cannot be accidentally disabled by a saved input;
//   • MISSED/no-chase events no longer impose the same cooldown as a real trade exit;
//   • per-lane daily READY/BUY/REJECT counters make silent signal suppression visible;
//   • the dashboard explicitly shows realtime/entry-window alert readiness.
//
// v0.8.2 behavior retained:
//   • Lane A/B/C no longer use the new liquidity filter as a qualification gate;
//   • Lane D may MONITOR in parallel with WAITING/READY legacy setups; the first valid trigger wins;
//   • If two lanes trigger on the same realtime update, earlier legacy A/B/C evaluation wins;
//   • Lane A remembers its latest expansion, pullback check and historical outcome for diagnostics;
//   • BUY/SELL notifications remain ON by default;
//   • dashboard wording says AUTO MONITORING rather than telling the user to WATCH.
//
// v0.7 safety improvements retained:
//   • soft VWAP tolerance for FAST MOVER discovery and Lane D setup formation,
//     while optionally requiring an actual VWAP reclaim before BUY;
//   • safer live-volume gating so a few seconds of volume cannot falsely look huge;
//   • repeatable watch episodes (capped per day) instead of one irreversible watch;
//   • liquidity and extension guards for more realistic execution;
//   • clearer VWAP/liquidity diagnostics and configurable dashboard position.
// All lanes remain PAPER ONLY until independently validated on forward NSE data.
// ============================================================================
//
// v0.8.14 OBSERVABILITY / SHADOW-ONLY RELEASE:
//   • LIVE A/B/C/D/E qualification, BUY, SELL, stop, target, sizing, session,
//     one-BUY/day, EC0/C0 and Lane-E trading policies remain frozen from v0.8.13.
//   • Adds EF0 (Lane-E Freshness / Exhaustion) forward-only measurement on each
//     ACTUAL Lane-E BUY. It snapshots whether volume genuinely renewed versus the
//     pullback, current-vs-remembered participation, initial risk/extension in ATR,
//     RS change, age of the confirmed mover-volume peak, and position versus the
//     prior session high.
//   • EF0 tracks the actual Lane-E structural stop against +1%/+2%/+3%, MFE/MAE,
//     5m/15m/30m returns and first-event ordering. The study continues after the
//     real trade exits so a stop-then-recovery can be distinguished from a true
//     collapse. It finalizes at 30 minutes or the configured force-exit boundary.
//   • EF0 is measurement only. No EF0 variable participates in actionable lane
//     predicates, sizing, stop management, BUY counters or dashboard ACTION.
//   • Research alerts default OFF. No new live filter is introduced.
// ============================================================================
//
// v0.8.13 OBSERVABILITY / SHADOW-ONLY RELEASE:
//   • LIVE A/B/C/D/E qualification, BUY, SELL, stop, target, sizing, session,
//     one-BUY/day and Lane-E policies remain frozen from v0.8.12.
//   • Adds EC0 (Early Confirmed) forward-only research for the specific
//     Discord→Pine timing gap. EC0 uses the EXISTING Fast-Mover context EXCEPT
//     it does not require the +4% minimum day-change gate. It then requires the
//     existing confirmed bullish 5m action-bar rule and enters hypothetically at
//     that confirmed close. No pullback, rebreak or second confirmation is added.
//   • EC0 is measurement only. It never changes any live lane state, consumes a
//     BUY slot, creates a PAPER BUY/SELL, or changes actionable alert qualification.
//   • EC0 measures +1%/+2%/+3% from the shadow close against BOTH a 1% reference
//     stop (matching the Python research ladder) and a simple structural bar-low
//     stop using the existing 0.05 ATR opening-drive buffer. It also records
//     MFE/MAE, time until current Fast Mover becomes true, and whether/when the
//     existing live Pine lanes eventually BUY.
//   • Research alerts default OFF. Hidden study levels are Data-Window only.
// ============================================================================
//
// v0.8.12 OBSERVABILITY / SHADOW-ONLY RELEASE:
//   • LIVE A/B/C/D/E qualification, BUY, SELL, stop, target, sizing, session,
//     one-BUY/day and Lane-E policies remain frozen from v0.8.11.
//   • Adds forward-only Lane-C0 research: when the EXISTING Lane-C momentum bar
//     fully qualifies/arms, C0 hypothetically enters at that same confirmed close
//     instead of waiting for the later continuation close. This never creates a
//     live position or actionable BUY/SELL alert.
//   • C0 measures fixed +1%/+2%/+3% research targets versus the same structural
//     stop, plus MFE/MAE and time-to-target. These are measurement levels only.
//   • Dashboard Why now exposes A/C/D coverage diagnostics during Fast Mover
//     episodes instead of hiding Lane-C rejection behind a generic message.
//   • Optional C coverage research alerts default OFF. No actionable alert
//     qualification/frequency is changed.
// ============================================================================
//
// v0.8.11 CORRECTNESS-ONLY RELEASE:
//   • A/B/C/D historical READY trigger consumption now mirrors the confirmed
//     bullish-close policy; a historical wick above entry no longer consumes READY.
//   • Protective STOP retains first priority; mandatory EOD force-exit now precedes
//     any new ordinary first-profit-take/partial event.
//   • Daily var/varip resets are one-shot on the first execution of the new-day bar.
//   • Actionable BUY/SELL alert() messages include static build/event/time metadata.
//   • No thresholds, entry geometry, risk math, Lane-E policy, session windows,
//     one-BUY/day count, realtime protective stops, or research hypotheses changed.
// ============================================================================
//
// v0.8.10 RESEARCH INSTRUMENTATION ONLY:
//   • The v0.8.9 actionable BUY/SELL predicates, A/B/C/D/E setup logic, actual
//     stops, sizing, partial take and runner management are intentionally frozen.
//   • Every LIVE Lane-E BUY starts a parallel shadow-stop study. Stop A is the
//     actual v0.8.9 stop. Stop B is a wider, NON-TRADING research stop built from
//     the lowest low of the prior 3 completed 5m bars minus a fixed 0.15 ATR buffer.
//   • The study tracks first stop/2R event for A and B, A-stop-then-recovery-to-2R,
//     MFE/MAE, +15m/+30m close outcomes and the 15:20 research mark.
//   • Stop B NEVER changes an order, alert quantity, actual stop, target or runner.
//   • Optional NG RESEARCH RESULT alert is OFF by default, preserving BUY/SELL-only
//     phone behavior. Enable it only when deliberately collecting study logs.
// ============================================================================

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Inputs
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grpContext = "1. Context"
benchSym   = input.symbol("NSE:NIFTY", "Benchmark for intraday RS", group=grpContext)
emaLen     = input.int(20, "EMA length", minval=2, group=grpContext)
volLen     = input.int(20, "Volume baseline length", minval=2, group=grpContext)
showPD     = input.bool(true, "Show previous-day high/low", group=grpContext)
showPW     = input.bool(true, "Show previous-week high/low", group=grpContext)
showVWAP   = input.bool(true, "Show session VWAP", group=grpContext)
showEMA    = input.bool(true, "Show EMA", group=grpContext)
showSetupGeometry = input.bool(true, "Show current setup entry/stop/target", group=grpContext)

grpRisk    = "2. Paper Risk"
rrMultiple = input.float(2.0, "First profit-take R", minval=1.0, step=0.25, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="This is no longer a hard full-exit target. At this R multiple the script takes a partial profit and keeps a runner when quantity allows.")
capital    = input.float(500000.0, "Account capital (₹)", minval=0, step=1000, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="Account reference only. Each TradingView chart is independent and cannot see positions on other symbols.")
maxPositionPct = input.float(15.0, "Max capital in one stock (%)", minval=1.0, maxval=100.0, step=1.0, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="Default 15% means a ₹5L account may use at most about ₹75,000 in one stock. This prevents a tiny stop from concentrating most of the account in one name.")
riskBudget = input.float(500.0, "Max paper risk per trade (₹)", minval=0, step=50, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="Maximum planned initial loss if the structural stop fills near its level. Position sizing also respects the per-stock capital cap.")
partialExitPct = input.float(50.0, "Sell at first profit-take (%)", minval=10.0, maxval=90.0, step=5.0, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="Default 50%: at the first profit-take level, bank half and keep the rest as a runner. If only one share fits, the position exits fully at the first profit-take.")
enableRunnerTrail = input.bool(true, "Trail the runner after partial", group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="After the partial, the remaining position's stop is raised to at least breakeven and may trail below the lowest low of recent completed 5m bars.")
runnerLookbackBars = input.int(3, "Runner structural-low lookback bars", minval=2, maxval=8, group=grpRisk,
     tooltip="Uses completed bars only. A 3-bar lookback gives the runner room while still ratcheting risk upward as the trend advances.")
runnerStopBufferAtr = input.float(0.05, "Runner stop buffer (ATR)", minval=0.0, maxval=0.50, step=0.05, group=grpRisk)

grpAlerts        = "3. Alerts"
actionAlertsOnly = input.bool(true, "BUY/SELL alerts only", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="When ON, only NG PAPER BUY NOW and NG PAPER SELL NOW alert() messages are sent. WATCH, BREAKOUT, SETUP READY and MISSED messages remain dashboard/internal states only.")
// Actionable BUY/SELL alert calls are intentionally always enabled in code.
// If a user does not want alerts, they simply do not create a TradingView alert.
// This removes a hidden saved-input failure mode where a valid BUY could occur
// while alert() was silently disabled inside the server-side script snapshot.
bool enablePineAlerts = true
enableFastMoverWatch = input.bool(true, "Send informational FAST MOVER alerts", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="Only applies when BUY/SELL alerts only is OFF. Informational only: this is NOT a BUY signal.")
enableSetupReadyAlerts = input.bool(true, "Send SETUP READY alerts", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="Only applies when BUY/SELL alerts only is OFF. Sends one informational alert when Lane A/B/C/D/E becomes READY. The later PAPER BUY alert still requires the lane trigger.")
enableBreakoutWatch = input.bool(true, "Send BREAKOUT / WATCH opportunity alerts", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="Only applies when BUY/SELL alerts only is OFF. Surfaces a confirmed fresh 8-bar breakout with valid trend/RS context and meaningful volume evidence even if no BUY lane qualifies. Informational only; never enters a paper trade.")
BREAKOUT_WATCH_MAX_DAY = input.int(3, "Maximum BREAKOUT / WATCH alerts per day", minval=1, maxval=10, group=grpAlerts)
BREAKOUT_WATCH_REARM_BARS = input.int(2, "Rearm BREAKOUT / WATCH after N non-candidate bars", minval=1, maxval=12, group=grpAlerts)
enableMissedAlerts = input.bool(false, "Send informational MISSED / NO-CHASE alerts", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="Default OFF. These messages are diagnostic only and do not require an action.")
enableAlertSelfTest = input.bool(false, "TEMP: one-shot alert pipeline self-test", group=grpAlerts,
     tooltip="Diagnostic only and suppressed while BUY/SELL alerts only is ON. To test wiring, temporarily turn BUY/SELL alerts only OFF, enable this, and use a temporary Any alert() function call alert.")

grpFast = "4. Fast Mover / Opening Drive"
enableLaneD          = input.bool(true, "Enable Lane D Opening Drive", group=grpFast)
FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT     = input.float(4.0, "Fast mover: minimum day change %", minval=0.5, step=0.5, group=grpFast)
FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT  = input.float(3.0, "Fast mover: minimum day RS vs benchmark %", minval=0.0, step=0.5, group=grpFast)
FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS = input.float(0.5, "Fast mover: minimum intraday RS from open %", minval=-2.0, step=0.25, group=grpFast)
FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE    = input.float(2.0, "Fast mover: minimum volume strength", minval=0.5, step=0.25, group=grpFast,
     tooltip="Uses a recent completed-bar volume burst and, after enough of the live bar has elapsed, live volume pace.")
FAST_MIN_LIVE_SECONDS  = input.int(60, "Fast mover: ignore live-bar pace for first N seconds", minval=0, maxval=240, step=15, group=grpFast)
FAST_VWAP_TOL_ATR      = input.float(0.20, "Fast-mover VWAP tolerance (ATR)", minval=0.0, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=grpFast,
     tooltip="Fast Mover/Lane D may stay valid slightly below VWAP by this ATR amount. This does not automatically authorize a BUY below VWAP.")
D_REQUIRE_VWAP_RECLAIM = input.bool(true, "Lane D: require price back above VWAP at BUY", group=grpFast,
     tooltip="Recommended ON. Setup formation can tolerate a shallow VWAP dip, but the actual Lane D BUY waits for price to reclaim VWAP.")
D_MAX_EXTENSION_ATR    = input.float(3.0, "Lane D: maximum entry extension above EMA (ATR)", minval=1.0, maxval=6.0, step=0.25, group=grpFast,
     tooltip="Prevents late opening-drive entries after price becomes excessively stretched above its EMA.")
FAST_MAX_WATCHES_DAY   = input.int(2, "Maximum fast-mover episodes tracked per day", minval=1, maxval=5, group=grpFast)
FAST_REARM_BARS        = input.int(3, "Rearm fast-mover episode after N non-qualifying bars", minval=1, maxval=12, group=grpFast)
D_END_HOUR           = input.int(10, "Lane D end hour (IST)", minval=9, maxval=12, group=grpFast)
D_END_MINUTE         = input.int(30, "Lane D end minute (IST)", minval=0, maxval=59, group=grpFast)

grpLate = "5. Lane E / Re-Acceleration"
enableLaneE = input.bool(true, "Enable Lane E late-arrival re-acceleration", group=grpLate,
     tooltip="PAPER hypothesis for late Discord/TradingView arrival after the opening-drive window. It ignores old historical entries, remembers abnormal volume already demonstrated earlier in today's session, waits for a new post-live quieter pullback/base, then requires a fresh local continuation trigger.")

grpSafety        = "6. Operational Safety"
ENTRY_START_HOUR     = input.int(9, "Start entries after hour (IST)", minval=9, maxval=15, group=grpSafety)
ENTRY_START_MINUTE   = input.int(20, "Start entries after minute (IST)", minval=0, maxval=59, group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Default 09:20 IST avoids entering during the still-forming opening 5-minute bar.")
ENTRY_CUTOFF_HOUR    = input.int(15, "No new entries after hour (IST)", minval=9, maxval=15, group=grpSafety)
ENTRY_CUTOFF_MINUTE  = input.int(0, "No new entries after minute (IST)", minval=0, maxval=59, group=grpSafety)
FORCE_EXIT_HOUR      = input.int(15, "Force paper exit hour (IST)", minval=14, maxval=15, group=grpSafety)
FORCE_EXIT_MINUTE    = input.int(20, "Force paper exit minute (IST)", minval=0, maxval=29, group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Default 15:20 IST closes any remaining paper trade before the NSE cash-session close.")
terminalCooldownBars = input.int(3, "Cooldown bars after a LIVE trade exit", minval=0, maxval=24, group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Applies after an actual paper trade exits. Default 3 bars = 15 minutes on a 5-minute chart.")
missedCooldownBars = input.int(0, "Cooldown bars after MISSED / no-chase", minval=0, maxval=6, group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Default 0. A rejected trigger did not create a position, so it should not silently block the lane for another 15 minutes.")
freshScanOnLoad      = input.bool(false, "Require a completely new setup after symbol/script load", group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="OFF keeps a still-valid, untouched setup reconstructed from earlier bars. Any setup whose trigger already traded is discarded. ON forces a brand-new setup after loading/switching symbols.")
maxBuysPerSymbolPerDay = input.int(1, "Maximum BUY entries per symbol per day", minval=1, maxval=3, group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Default 1 prevents churn/re-entry alerts on the same stock after a stop. Increase only after forward evidence shows same-day re-entry adds expectancy.")
enableLiquidityFilter = input.bool(true, "Lane D: require minimum average 5m turnover", group=grpSafety,
     tooltip="Applies to Fast Mover/Lane D only. Legacy Lane A/B/C keep the v0.5 qualification behavior. The dashboard still shows liquidity as a warning.")
minAvg5mTurnover      = input.float(250000.0, "Lane D minimum average 5m turnover (₹)", minval=0, step=50000, group=grpSafety)

grpDisplay = "7. Dashboard"
dashboardPosInput = input.string("Top Right", "Dashboard position",
     options=["Top Right", "Top Left", "Middle Right", "Middle Left", "Bottom Right", "Bottom Left"], group=grpDisplay)
showDashboard = input.bool(true, "Show dashboard", group=grpDisplay)

grpDebug         = "8. Research / Debug"
showDebugMarkers = input.bool(false, "Show EXP / READY / MISS markers", group=grpDebug)
showTradeMarkers = input.bool(true, "Show live PAPER BUY / SELL markers", group=grpDebug)

grpStudy = "9. Lane E Shadow Study"
enableEShadowStudy = input.bool(true, "Track Lane E current stop vs wider shadow stop", group=grpStudy,
     tooltip="Measurement only. Does NOT change BUY/SELL logic. Stop A is the actual Lane-E stop. Stop B is a wider 3-bar structural + 0.15 ATR shadow stop used only to learn whether A is too tight.")
enableResearchResultAlerts = input.bool(false, "Send EOD research-result alert", group=grpStudy,
     tooltip="Default OFF so normal alerts remain BUY/SELL only. If enabled, one NG RESEARCH RESULT message is emitted around the configured 15:20 safety-exit time for a Lane-E study.")

// Preregistered measurement constants. These are NOT live trading parameters.
int   E_STUDY_SHADOW_LOOKBACK   = 3
float E_STUDY_SHADOW_BUFFER_ATR = 0.15

grpCStudy = "10. Lane C Coverage Shadow Study"
enableC0ShadowStudy = input.bool(true, "Track same-bar confirmed Lane C shadow entry", group=grpCStudy,
     tooltip="Measurement only. Starts only when the EXISTING Lane-C setup fully qualifies/arms on a realtime confirmed bar. C0 hypothetically enters at that qualifying close while live Lane C remains unchanged and still waits for its existing continuation trigger.")
enableCCoverageResearchAlerts = input.bool(false, "Send Lane C coverage research alerts", group=grpCStudy,
     tooltip="Default OFF. When enabled, emits diagnostic C-attempt and C0-result research messages. These are never actionable BUY/SELL signals.")

// Preregistered C0 measurement levels. These are NOT live trading parameters.
float C0_STUDY_T1_PCT = 1.0
float C0_STUDY_T2_PCT = 2.0
float C0_STUDY_T3_PCT = 3.0

grpEarlyStudy = "11. Early Confirmed Candidate Shadow"
enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy = input.bool(true, "Track early confirmed candidate shadow", group=grpEarlyStudy,
     tooltip="Measurement only. Forward-only. Uses the existing Fast-Mover context with only the +4% day-change requirement removed, then requires the existing confirmed bullish 5m close. It never changes live BUY/SELL logic.")
enableEarlyConfirmedResearchAlerts = input.bool(false, "Send early-confirmed research alerts", group=grpEarlyStudy,
     tooltip="Default OFF. Emits NG RESEARCH EC0 entry/result messages only. These are not actionable BUY/SELL signals.")

// Preregistered EC0 measurement levels. These are NOT live trading parameters.
float EC0_STUDY_REF_STOP_PCT = 1.0
float EC0_STUDY_T1_PCT       = 1.0
float EC0_STUDY_T2_PCT       = 2.0
float EC0_STUDY_T3_PCT       = 3.0

grpEFreshStudy = "12. Lane E Freshness / Exhaustion Shadow"
enableEFreshStudy = input.bool(true, "Track Lane E freshness / exhaustion", group=grpEFreshStudy,
     tooltip="Measurement only. Snapshots freshness at each ACTUAL Lane-E BUY and tracks +1%/+2%/+3% versus the existing Lane-E stop for 30 minutes. Does NOT change BUY/SELL logic.")
enableEFreshResearchAlerts = input.bool(false, "Send Lane E freshness research alerts", group=grpEFreshStudy,
     tooltip="Default OFF. Emits NG RESEARCH EF0 entry/result messages only. These are not actionable BUY/SELL signals.")

// Preregistered EF0 measurement levels. These are NOT live trading parameters.
float EF0_STUDY_T1_PCT = 1.0
float EF0_STUDY_T2_PCT = 2.0
float EF0_STUDY_T3_PCT = 3.0
int   EF0_STUDY_HORIZON_BARS = 6

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// FROZEN v0.2 hypothesis constants. Do not tune from screenshots.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
int   ATR_LEN                       = 14
int   BREAKOUT_LOOKBACK             = 8
float MIN_EXPANSION_RANGE_ATR       = 1.00
float MIN_EXPANSION_BODY_FRACTION   = 0.60
float MIN_EXPANSION_CLOSE_POSITION  = 0.70
float MIN_EXPANSION_VOLUME_RATIO    = 1.50
int   MAX_BARS_TO_FIRST_PULLBACK    = 4
int   MAX_PULLBACK_BARS             = 3
int   MAX_READY_BARS                = 4
float MAX_PULLBACK_RETRACE_FRACTION = 0.55
float MAX_PULLBACK_RANGE_VS_EXP     = 0.80
float MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R         = 0.25
int   TERMINAL_COOLDOWN_BARS        = 12

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// FROZEN v0.3 Lane B hypothesis constants. Do not tune from screenshots.
// Important-level breakout -> acceptance/retest -> continuation.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
float B_BREAK_BUFFER_ATR          = 0.03
float B_MIN_BODY_FRACTION        = 0.50
float B_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION       = 0.60
float B_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO         = 1.20
int   B_MAX_BARS_TO_ACCEPT       = 4
float B_LEVEL_TOUCH_TOL_ATR      = 0.15
float B_MAX_UNDERCUT_ATR         = 0.10
float B_MAX_ACCEPT_RANGE_ATR     = 0.80
float B_MAX_ACCEPT_EXTENSION_ATR = 0.75
int   B_MAX_READY_BARS           = 4
float B_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R    = 0.25
int   B_TERMINAL_COOLDOWN_BARS   = 12

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// FROZEN v0.4 Lane C hypothesis constants. Do not tune from screenshots.
// Immediate momentum continuation: strong confirmed expansion -> break its high.
// No pullback/retest is required.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
float C_MIN_RANGE_ATR             = 1.00
float C_MIN_BODY_FRACTION         = 0.65
float C_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION        = 0.75
float C_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO          = 2.00
float C_MIN_RS_PCT                = 1.00
float C_MAX_CLOSE_ABOVE_EMA_ATR   = 2.00
float C_STOP_BUFFER_ATR           = 0.05
float C_MAX_RISK_ATR              = 0.90
float C_MIN_ROOM_R                = 1.00
int   C_MAX_TRIGGER_BARS          = 2
float C_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R     = 0.25
int   C_TERMINAL_COOLDOWN_BARS    = 12

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane D — Opening Drive / Fast Mover.
// This lane does NOT buy the vertical impulse. It waits for a brief micro-pause
// and then requires a fresh break of that pause high.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
float D_MIN_IMPULSE_RANGE_ATR      = 0.75
float D_MIN_IMPULSE_BODY_FRACTION  = 0.50
float D_MIN_IMPULSE_CLOSE_POSITION = 0.65
float D_MIN_COMPLETED_VOL_RATIO    = 1.50
float D_MAX_PAUSE_RANGE_VS_IMPULSE = 0.75
float D_MAX_PAUSE_RETRACE          = 0.45
int   D_MAX_BARS_TO_PAUSE          = 3
int   D_MAX_READY_BARS             = 3
float D_STOP_BUFFER_ATR            = 0.05
float D_MAX_RISK_ATR               = 1.10
float D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R      = 0.25

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Helpers
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const string BUILD_ID = "v0.8.14"

maxPositionValue = capital * maxPositionPct / 100.0

calcQty(float entryPrice, float stopPrice) =>
    float riskPerShare = not na(entryPrice) and not na(stopPrice) and entryPrice > stopPrice ? entryPrice - stopPrice : na
    float byRisk       = not na(riskPerShare) and riskPerShare > 0 ? math.floor(riskBudget / riskPerShare) : 0.0
    float byPosition   = not na(entryPrice) and entryPrice > 0 ? math.floor(maxPositionValue / entryPrice) : 0.0
    math.max(math.min(byRisk, byPosition), 0.0)

calcPartialQty(float initialQty) =>
    initialQty >= 2 ? math.max(math.floor(initialQty * partialExitPct / 100.0), 1.0) : initialQty

calcRunnerStop(float entryPrice, float currentStop, float recentCompletedLow, float atrValue) =>
    float buffer = not na(atrValue) ? atrValue * runnerStopBufferAtr : syminfo.mintick
    float structuralCandidate = not na(recentCompletedLow) ? recentCompletedLow - buffer : entryPrice
    math.max(currentStop, math.max(entryPrice, structuralCandidate))

maxNa(float a, float b) =>
    na(a) ? b : na(b) ? a : math.max(a, b)

fmtTimeIST(int ts) =>
    na(ts) ? "—" : str.tostring(hour(ts, "Asia/Kolkata"), "00") + ":" + str.tostring(minute(ts, "Asia/Kolkata"), "00")

actionMeta(string eventType, int ts) =>
    " | Build " + BUILD_ID + " | EventType " + eventType + " | Symbol " + syminfo.ticker + " | BarTime " + fmtTimeIST(ts)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Core context
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bool isFiveMinute = timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier == 5

ema20 = ta.ema(close, emaLen)
vwap  = ta.vwap(hlc3)
atr   = ta.atr(ATR_LEN)

// Previous COMPLETED higher-timeframe levels.
pdh = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", high[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
pdl = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", low[1],  gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
pwh = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", high[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
pwl = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", low[1],  gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)

// Full-day + intraday strength model:
// 1) Full-day change: current price vs previous completed daily close.
// 2) Full-day RS: stock full-day change minus benchmark full-day change.
// 3) Intraday RS: stock move from today's open minus benchmark move from today's open.
// Keeping both prevents large gap-up leaders from looking deceptively weak on the dashboard.
stockDayOpen    = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", open, gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
stockPrevClose  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", close[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
benchClose      = request.security(benchSym, timeframe.period, close, gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
benchDayOpen    = request.security(benchSym, "D", open, gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
benchPrevClose  = request.security(benchSym, "D", close[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)

stockRetPct = not na(stockDayOpen) and stockDayOpen != 0 ? (close / stockDayOpen - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
benchRetPct = not na(benchDayOpen) and benchDayOpen != 0 ? (benchClose / benchDayOpen - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
rsSpreadPct = not na(stockRetPct) and not na(benchRetPct) ? stockRetPct - benchRetPct : na

stockDayPct = not na(stockPrevClose) and stockPrevClose != 0 ? (close / stockPrevClose - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
benchDayPct = not na(benchPrevClose) and benchPrevClose != 0 ? (benchClose / benchPrevClose - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
dayRsPct    = not na(stockDayPct) and not na(benchDayPct) ? stockDayPct - benchDayPct : na

// Completed-bar ratios remain the basis for the frozen A/B/C hypotheses.
// Live pace is deliberately ignored during the first part of a realtime bar so
// a handful of early prints cannot create an exaggerated FAST MOVER reading.
completedVolAvg = ta.sma(volume[1], volLen)
barSeconds      = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.period)
elapsedSeconds  = barstate.isrealtime and barSeconds > 0 ? math.max((timenow - time) / 1000.0, 1.0) : barSeconds
elapsedFracRaw  = barSeconds > 0 ? elapsedSeconds / barSeconds : 1.0
elapsedFrac     = math.min(math.max(elapsedFracRaw, 0.05), 1.0)
expectedVolNow  = not na(completedVolAvg) ? completedVolAvg * elapsedFrac : na
volPace         = not na(volume) and not na(expectedVolNow) and expectedVolNow > 0 ? volume / expectedVolNow : na
completedBarVolRatio = not na(completedVolAvg) and completedVolAvg > 0 ? volume / completedVolAvg : na
recentCompletedVolBurst = ta.highest(completedBarVolRatio[1], 3)
liveVolPaceUsable = (not barstate.isrealtime or elapsedSeconds >= FAST_MIN_LIVE_SECONDS) ? volPace : na
fastVolStrength = maxNa(recentCompletedVolBurst, liveVolPaceUsable)

// Runner trailing uses completed bars only; current partial-bar lows cannot tighten the stop.
runnerRecentLow = ta.lowest(low[1], runnerLookbackBars)

// Liquidity guard uses completed 5m bars so the current partial bar cannot
// temporarily make a thin stock look liquid.
completedTurnover = close[1] * volume[1]
avg5mTurnover     = ta.sma(completedTurnover, volLen)
liquidityOk       = not enableLiquidityFilter or (not na(avg5mTurnover) and avg5mTurnover >= minAvg5mTurnover)

emaTrendUp = close > ema20 and ema20 > ema20[1]
aboveVWAP  = close > vwap
vwapTol    = not na(atr) ? atr * FAST_VWAP_TOL_ATR : 0.0
nearVWAP   = not na(vwap) and close >= vwap - vwapTol
fastVwapOk = aboveVWAP or nearVWAP
rsLeader   = not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
// IMPORTANT: contextGood is the v0.5 legacy A/B/C context. Do not add
// Lane-D-only filters (such as liquidity) here, or they can suppress legacy trades.
contextGood = isFiveMinute and emaTrendUp and aboveVWAP and rsLeader

dayLeader = not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct > 0
fastMoverCore = isFiveMinute and emaTrendUp and fastVwapOk and liquidityOk and
     not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS and
     not na(fastVolStrength) and fastVolStrength >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE

// NSE cash-session and operational clocks.
// Historical calculations use each bar's close time. Realtime calculations use
// the actual wall clock so the 14:55 bar cannot remain entry-eligible at 15:00.
bool inNseCashSession = not na(time(timeframe.period, "0915-1530:23456", "Asia/Kolkata"))
bool wallClockInsideBar = timenow >= time and timenow < time_close
sessionClock = wallClockInsideBar ? timenow : time_close
istHour      = hour(sessionClock, "Asia/Kolkata")
istMinute    = minute(sessionClock, "Asia/Kolkata")

afterEntryStart = istHour > ENTRY_START_HOUR or (istHour == ENTRY_START_HOUR and istMinute >= ENTRY_START_MINUTE)
beforeEntryCutoff = istHour < ENTRY_CUTOFF_HOUR or (istHour == ENTRY_CUTOFF_HOUR and istMinute < ENTRY_CUTOFF_MINUTE)
beforeForceExit = istHour < FORCE_EXIT_HOUR or (istHour == FORCE_EXIT_HOUR and istMinute < FORCE_EXIT_MINUTE)
entryWindowOpen = inNseCashSession and afterEntryStart and beforeEntryCutoff and beforeForceExit

atOrAfterForceExit = istHour > FORCE_EXIT_HOUR or (istHour == FORCE_EXIT_HOUR and istMinute >= FORCE_EXIT_MINUTE)
forceExitNow = barstate.isrealtime and inNseCashSession and atOrAfterForceExit

newDay = ta.change(time("D")) != 0
newDayReset = newDay and (not barstate.isrealtime or barstate.isnew)

// EF0 measurement-only session-high memory. This is never used by live lane logic.
var float ef0SessionHigh = na
var int   ef0SessionHighBar = na
if newDayReset
    ef0SessionHigh := na
    ef0SessionHighBar := na
if inNseCashSession
    if na(ef0SessionHigh) or high > ef0SessionHigh
        ef0SessionHigh := high
        ef0SessionHighBar := bar_index

// Session volume memory for late-arrival logic. This is deliberately NOT the
// raw highest-volume bar of the day. Opening volume is naturally large, so using
// any session peak would make the 2x test almost meaningless by lunchtime.
// Instead we remember volume only from bars that ALSO had the existing Fast-Mover
// price/RS/trend/liquidity context. Historical reconstruction is causal because
// each bar can only contribute its own completed information.
var float sessionMoverVolPeak = na
var int   sessionMoverVolBar  = na
if newDayReset
    sessionMoverVolPeak := na
    sessionMoverVolBar := na

completedMoverContext = barstate.isconfirmed and inNseCashSession and isFiveMinute and
     emaTrendUp and close > vwap and liquidityOk and
     not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS
if completedMoverContext and not na(completedBarVolRatio)
    if na(sessionMoverVolPeak) or completedBarVolRatio > sessionMoverVolPeak
        sessionMoverVolPeak := completedBarVolRatio
        sessionMoverVolBar := bar_index

liveMoverContext = barstate.isrealtime and entryWindowOpen and isFiveMinute and
     emaTrendUp and fastVwapOk and liquidityOk and
     not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS
liveMoverVolEvidence = liveMoverContext ? liveVolPaceUsable : na

sessionVolStrength = maxNa(sessionMoverVolPeak, liveMoverVolEvidence)
sessionVolImpulseOk = not na(sessionVolStrength) and sessionVolStrength >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE

dBeforeEnd = istHour < D_END_HOUR or (istHour == D_END_HOUR and istMinute < D_END_MINUTE)
dWindowOpen = entryWindowOpen and dBeforeEnd
eWindowOpen = entryWindowOpen and not dBeforeEnd

// Optional one-shot alert-pipeline diagnostic.
// This does not participate in setup qualification and does not alter lane state.
// It is intended for a TEMPORARY TradingView alert snapshot only.
varip bool alertSelfTestSent = false
alertSelfTestEligible = barstate.isrealtime and isFiveMinute and inNseCashSession
alertSelfTestNow = not actionAlertsOnly and enableAlertSelfTest and alertSelfTestEligible and not alertSelfTestSent
if alertSelfTestNow
    alertSelfTestSent := true
    alert("NG ALERT PIPELINE OK | " + syminfo.ticker +
          " | " + timeframe.period +
          " | alert() wiring is active",
          alert.freq_all)

// FAST MOVER episodes are tracked internally whether or not informational
// notifications are enabled. An optional info alert may fire later in the
// session only after the symbol has spent several confirmed bars outside the
// qualifying state, and the daily count remains capped.
varip int  fastWatchCount = 0
varip int  fastWatchOffBars = 0
varip bool fastWatchArmed = true
varip int  fastWatchEventBar = na
if newDayReset
    fastWatchCount := 0
    fastWatchOffBars := 0
    fastWatchArmed := true
    fastWatchEventBar := na

if barstate.isconfirmed
    if fastMoverCore
        fastWatchOffBars := 0
    else
        fastWatchOffBars += 1
        if fastWatchOffBars >= FAST_REARM_BARS
            fastWatchArmed := true

fastWatchNow = barstate.isrealtime and entryWindowOpen and fastMoverCore and fastWatchArmed and
     fastWatchCount < FAST_MAX_WATCHES_DAY
if fastWatchNow
    fastWatchArmed := false
    fastWatchCount += 1
    fastWatchEventBar := bar_index
    if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableFastMoverWatch
        string vwapAlertState = aboveVWAP ? "ABOVE" : "NEAR"
        alert("NG FAST MOVER / WATCH | " + syminfo.ticker +
              " | Day " + str.tostring(stockDayPct, "#.##") + "%" +
              " | DayRS " + str.tostring(dayRsPct, "#.##") + "%" +
              " | IntraRS " + str.tostring(rsSpreadPct, "#.##") + "%" +
              " | VolStrength " + str.tostring(fastVolStrength, "#.##") + "x" +
              " | VWAP " + vwapAlertState +
              " | EMA UP | WAIT FOR SAFE ENTRY",
              alert.freq_all)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Frozen expansion definition
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
barRange      = high - low
bullBody      = close - open
bodyFraction  = barRange > 0 ? bullBody / barRange : 0.0
closePosition = barRange > 0 ? (close - low) / barRange : 0.5
priorHigh     = ta.highest(high[1], BREAKOUT_LOOKBACK)

expansionSignal = barstate.isconfirmed and contextGood and
     close > open and
     not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh and
     not na(atr) and atr > 0 and barRange >= atr * MIN_EXPANSION_RANGE_ATR and
     bodyFraction >= MIN_EXPANSION_BODY_FRACTION and
     closePosition >= MIN_EXPANSION_CLOSE_POSITION and
     not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio >= MIN_EXPANSION_VOLUME_RATIO

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Opportunity coverage watch (retained from v0.8.5)
// This is deliberately NOT another BUY lane. Its job is to stop the assistant
// from being silent when a stock breaks out with good context but misses one of
// the frozen lane-specific shapes (range/body/current-bar-volume/pullback).
//
// We reuse thresholds that already existed in v0.8.4 rather than inventing a
// screenshot-fitted rule: a fresh 8-bar breakout + legacy context + either the
// Lane-B completed-bar volume floor OR the existing Fast-Mover volume-strength
// floor. A Fast Mover may still receive a later confirmed breakout WATCH; only a
// enabled FAST MOVER notification on the exact same update suppresses the duplicate WATCH.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
breakoutWatchCandidate = barstate.isconfirmed and entryWindowOpen and contextGood and
     close > open and not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh and
     ((not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio >= B_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO) or
      (not na(fastVolStrength) and fastVolStrength >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE))

varip int  breakoutWatchCount = 0
varip int  breakoutWatchOffBars = 0
varip bool breakoutWatchArmed = true
varip int  breakoutWatchEventBar = na

if newDayReset
    breakoutWatchCount := 0
    breakoutWatchOffBars := 0
    breakoutWatchArmed := true
    breakoutWatchEventBar := na

if barstate.isconfirmed
    if breakoutWatchCandidate
        breakoutWatchOffBars := 0
    else
        breakoutWatchOffBars += 1
        if breakoutWatchOffBars >= BREAKOUT_WATCH_REARM_BARS
            breakoutWatchArmed := true

breakoutWatchNow = barstate.isrealtime and breakoutWatchCandidate and breakoutWatchArmed and
     not (fastWatchNow and enableFastMoverWatch) and breakoutWatchCount < BREAKOUT_WATCH_MAX_DAY
if breakoutWatchNow
    breakoutWatchArmed := false
    breakoutWatchCount += 1
    breakoutWatchEventBar := bar_index
    if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableBreakoutWatch
        alert("NG BREAKOUT / WATCH ONLY | " + syminfo.ticker +
              " | Fresh 8-bar close breakout" +
              " | Day " + str.tostring(stockDayPct, "#.##") + "%" +
              " | IntraRS " + str.tostring(rsSpreadPct, "#.##") + "%" +
              " | BarVol " + (na(completedBarVolRatio) ? "—" : str.tostring(completedBarVolRatio, "#.##") + "x") +
              " | VolStrength " + (na(fastVolStrength) ? "—" : str.tostring(fastVolStrength, "#.##") + "x") +
              " | ABOVE VWAP / EMA UP" +
              " | REVIEW STRUCTURE — NOT A BUY SIGNAL",
              alert.freq_all)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Automatic state machine
//  0 = scanning
//  1 = expansion found, waiting for first controlled pullback
//  2 = setup ready, waiting for trigger
//  3 = paper trade active
//  4 = completed/full exit (first-take full, EOD, or other terminal exit)
// -1 = stop hit / exited
//  5 = trigger missed / no chase
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
varip int   autoState        = 0
// Lane B/C states are predeclared here so every lane can enforce the same
// one-live-paper-position-per-symbol rule, regardless of code order.
varip int   bState           = 0
varip int   cState           = 0
varip int   dState           = 0
varip int   eState           = 0
varip int   expansionBar     = na
varip float expansionLow     = na
varip float expansionRange   = na
varip float expansionVolume  = na
varip float peakHigh         = na
varip int   pullbackStartBar = na
varip int   pullbackBars     = 0
varip int   readyBar         = na

varip float autoEntry        = na
varip float autoStop         = na
varip float autoTarget       = na
varip float autoRisk         = na
varip float autoManagedStop  = na
varip float autoInitialQty    = na
varip float autoRemainingQty  = na
varip bool  autoPartialTaken  = false
varip int   autoPartialEventBar = na

varip int entryEventBar      = na
varip int stopEventBar       = na
varip int targetEventBar     = na
varip int missedEventBar     = na
varip int terminalBar        = na
varip string aLastExitReason = ""

// Lane-A setup memory. These diagnostics survive normal setup resets so the
// dashboard can explain earlier pullbacks after the lane has moved on.
varip int    aLastExpansionTime = na
varip int    aLastPbCheckTime   = na
varip string aLastPbCheckReason = "—"
varip string aLastSetupEvent    = "—"

varip bool liveEngineStarted = false

// Daily audit counters. They reconstruct from historical bars and then continue
// in realtime. They do not change entry qualification; they only expose where
// candidates are being filtered before an actionable BUY.
varip int aReadyToday  = 0
varip int aBuyToday    = 0
varip int aRejectToday = 0
varip int bReadyToday  = 0
varip int bBuyToday    = 0
varip int bRejectToday = 0
varip int cReadyToday  = 0
varip int cBuyToday    = 0
varip int cRejectToday = 0
varip int dReadyToday  = 0
varip int dBuyToday    = 0
varip int dRejectToday = 0
varip int eReadyToday  = 0
varip int eBuyToday    = 0
varip int eRejectToday = 0

if newDayReset
    aReadyToday  := 0
    aBuyToday    := 0
    aRejectToday := 0
    bReadyToday  := 0
    bBuyToday    := 0
    bRejectToday := 0
    cReadyToday  := 0
    cBuyToday    := 0
    cRejectToday := 0
    dReadyToday  := 0
    dBuyToday    := 0
    dRejectToday := 0
    eReadyToday  := 0
    eBuyToday    := 0
    eRejectToday := 0

// Operational de-duplication across ALL lanes on this symbol. A BUY from any
// lane consumes one same-day symbol slot. This prevents A/B/C/D/E from churning
// the same stock after a fast stop or from producing multiple BUY alerts a few
// minutes apart. The default is intentionally one BUY per symbol per day.
int symbolBuysToday = aBuyToday + bBuyToday + cBuyToday + dBuyToday + eBuyToday
bool symbolBuySlotOpen = symbolBuysToday < maxBuysPerSymbolPerDay

// v0.8.9 action-quality rule: a BUY can only fire on the confirmed close of a
// bullish 5-minute bar that closes through the lane's trigger. Intrabar touches
// may arm/observe a setup but can never produce an actionable BUY. Protective
// SELL stops remain realtime so risk is not delayed to bar close.
bool confirmedBullishActionBar = barstate.isconfirmed and close > open

bool resetToScan = false

if not symbolBuySlotOpen and autoState != 3 and (autoState == 1 or autoState == 2)
    resetToScan := true

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    autoState        := 0
    expansionBar     := na
    expansionLow     := na
    expansionRange   := na
    expansionVolume  := na
    peakHigh         := na
    pullbackStartBar := na
    pullbackBars     := 0
    readyBar         := na
    autoEntry        := na
    autoStop         := na
    autoTarget       := na
    autoRisk         := na
    autoManagedStop  := na
    autoInitialQty    := na
    autoRemainingQty  := na
    autoPartialTaken  := false
    autoPartialEventBar := na
    entryEventBar    := na
    stopEventBar     := na
    targetEventBar   := na
    missedEventBar   := na
    terminalBar      := na
    aLastExitReason  := ""
    aLastExpansionTime := na
    aLastPbCheckTime   := na
    aLastPbCheckReason := "—"
    aLastSetupEvent    := "—"

// Terminal state stays visible briefly, then scanning resumes.
if (autoState == 4 or autoState == -1) and not na(terminalBar) and bar_index - terminalBar >= terminalCooldownBars
    resetToScan := true
if autoState == 5 and not na(terminalBar) and bar_index - terminalBar >= missedCooldownBars
    resetToScan := true

// At/after the entry cutoff, abandon any not-yet-entered Lane A candidate.
// A live paper trade (state 3) continues to be managed by its frozen initial risk and runner rules.
if not entryWindowOpen and (autoState == 1 or autoState == 2)
    resetToScan := true

// Start a candidate only from scanning state.
if autoState == 0 and symbolBuySlotOpen and entryWindowOpen and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and expansionSignal
    autoState        := 1
    expansionBar     := bar_index
    expansionLow     := low
    expansionRange   := barRange
    expansionVolume  := volume
    peakHigh         := high
    pullbackStartBar := na
    pullbackBars     := 0
    readyBar         := na
    autoEntry        := na
    autoStop         := na
    autoTarget       := na
    autoRisk         := na
    autoManagedStop  := na
    autoInitialQty    := na
    autoRemainingQty  := na
    autoPartialTaken  := false
    autoPartialEventBar := na
    entryEventBar    := na
    stopEventBar     := na
    targetEventBar   := na
    missedEventBar   := na
    aLastExitReason  := ""
    aLastExpansionTime := time
    aLastPbCheckTime   := na
    aLastPbCheckReason := "Waiting for first controlled PB"
    aLastSetupEvent    := "Expansion " + fmtTimeIST(time)

// Wait for first controlled pullback.
if autoState == 1 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > expansionBar
    peakHigh := math.max(peakHigh, high)

    impulseHeight = peakHigh - expansionLow
    retraceFrac   = impulseHeight > 0 ? (peakHigh - low) / impulseHeight : 1.0
    pullbackRange = high - low

    pullbackDirection = close < close[1] or close < open or high < high[1]
    pullbackRangeOk   = pullbackRange <= expansionRange * MAX_PULLBACK_RANGE_VS_EXP
    pullbackVolOk     = volume < expansionVolume
    pullbackEmaOk     = close > ema20
    pullbackVwapOk    = close > vwap
    pullbackRsOk      = not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    pullbackContextOk = pullbackEmaOk and pullbackVwapOk and pullbackRsOk
    pullbackRetraceOk = retraceFrac >= 0 and retraceFrac <= MAX_PULLBACK_RETRACE_FRACTION

    controlledPullback = pullbackDirection and pullbackRangeOk and pullbackVolOk and pullbackContextOk and pullbackRetraceOk
    hardInvalidation   = low <= expansionLow or close < vwap or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)

    // Preserve the latest PB evaluation. This does not change the v0.5 rules.
    aLastPbCheckTime := time
    aLastPbCheckReason := hardInvalidation ? (low <= expansionLow ? "Invalid: below expansion low" : close < vwap ? "Invalid: below VWAP" : "Invalid: RS lost") :
         controlledPullback ? "QUALIFIED" :
         not pullbackDirection ? "No pullback shape" :
         not pullbackRangeOk ? "Range too large" :
         not pullbackVolOk ? "Volume not lower" :
         not pullbackEmaOk ? "Below EMA" :
         not pullbackVwapOk ? "Below VWAP" :
         not pullbackRsOk ? "RS not positive" :
         not pullbackRetraceOk ? "Retrace >55%" : "Not qualified"

    if hardInvalidation
        aLastSetupEvent := "Invalidated " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        resetToScan := true
    else if controlledPullback
        pullbackStartBar := bar_index
        pullbackBars     := 1
        readyBar         := bar_index
        autoEntry        := high + syminfo.mintick
        autoStop         := low - syminfo.mintick
        autoRisk         := autoEntry - autoStop
        autoTarget       := autoEntry + autoRisk * rrMultiple
        autoState        := autoRisk > 0 ? 2 : 0
        if autoRisk > 0
            aReadyToday += 1
            if barstate.isrealtime and enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableSetupReadyAlerts
                alert("NG SETUP READY | Lane A FIRST PULLBACK | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Trigger " + str.tostring(autoEntry, format.mintick) +
                      " | SL " + str.tostring(autoStop, format.mintick) +
                          " | WAIT FOR TRIGGER — NOT YET A BUY",
                      alert.freq_all)
        aLastSetupEvent  := autoRisk > 0 ? "PB qualified " + fmtTimeIST(time) : "PB risk invalid " + fmtTimeIST(time)
    else if bar_index - expansionBar >= MAX_BARS_TO_FIRST_PULLBACK
        aLastSetupEvent := "No qualifying PB in 4 bars"
        resetToScan := true

// First realtime execution after loading/switching: never emit a late BUY.
// By default, an untouched historical setup may remain armed. A setup whose
// trigger already traded is discarded immediately without poisoning the live
// lane with a historical cooldown. freshScanOnLoad can force a brand-new setup.
if barstate.isrealtime and not liveEngineStarted
    liveEngineStarted := true
    if freshScanOnLoad and (autoState == 1 or autoState == 2)
        aLastSetupEvent := "Discarded on live load " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        resetToScan := true
    else if autoState == 2 and high >= autoEntry
        aLastSetupEvent := "Trigger already passed " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        resetToScan := true

// Historical trigger consumption mirrors the confirmed bullish close-through policy.
// A wick above entry alone does not consume READY or suppress the current live scan.
if autoState == 2 and not barstate.isrealtime and confirmedBullishActionBar and close >= autoEntry
    aLastSetupEvent := "Historical trigger passed " + fmtTimeIST(time)
    resetToScan := true

// Stop touched before entry invalidates the setup.
if autoState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and close <= autoStop
    aLastSetupEvent := "Setup invalidated " + fmtTimeIST(time)
    resetToScan := true

// If another lane owns the paper position when this trigger trades, expire the
// setup immediately. It may not become a delayed/chased entry after that trade exits.
if autoState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and (bState == 3 or cState == 3 or dState == 3 or eState == 3) and high >= autoEntry
    aLastSetupEvent := "Trigger passed while other lane in trade"
    resetToScan := true

// Realtime trigger. Buy only near the predefined level and only if at least one
// share fits both the risk budget and capital limit.
if autoState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and symbolBuySlotOpen and confirmedBullishActionBar and entryWindowOpen and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and not resetToScan and close >= autoEntry
    entryContextOk = close > ema20 and close > vwap and not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    plannedRisk    = autoRisk
    overshootR     = plannedRisk > 0 ? (close - autoEntry) / plannedRisk : 999.0
    entryFill      = close
    entryFillRisk  = entryFill - autoStop
    entryQty       = calcQty(entryFill, autoStop)

    if entryContextOk and overshootR <= MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R and entryFillRisk > 0 and entryQty >= 1
        autoEntry       := entryFill
        autoRisk        := entryFillRisk
        autoTarget      := autoEntry + autoRisk * rrMultiple
        autoState       := 3
        autoManagedStop := autoStop
        autoInitialQty   := entryQty
        autoRemainingQty := entryQty
        autoPartialTaken := false
        autoPartialEventBar := na
        entryEventBar   := bar_index
        aBuyToday      += 1
        aLastSetupEvent := "LIVE BUY " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER BUY NOW | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(autoEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(autoStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | Qty " + str.tostring(entryQty, "#") +
                  " | Position ₹" + str.tostring(entryQty * autoEntry, "#.##") +
                  " | MaxRisk ₹" + str.tostring(entryQty * autoRisk, "#.##") +
                  " | PosCap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#.##") +
                  " | FirstTake " + str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R @ " + str.tostring(autoTarget, format.mintick) +
                  " | Then RUNNER" + actionMeta("BUY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        reasonA = entryQty < 1 ? "QTY 0 / RISK TOO LARGE" : not entryContextOk ? "CONTEXT LOST" : "NO CHASE"
        autoState      := 5
        missedEventBar := bar_index
        terminalBar    := bar_index
        aRejectToday  += 1
        aLastSetupEvent := "REJECT " + reasonA + " " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableMissedAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER MISSED | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | " + reasonA +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(autoEntry, format.mintick),
                  alert.freq_all)

// A continuing controlled pullback can refine trigger/stop for up to 3 bars.
if autoState == 2 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > readyBar
    impulseHeight2 = peakHigh - expansionLow
    retraceFrac2   = impulseHeight2 > 0 ? (peakHigh - low) / impulseHeight2 : 1.0
    pullbackRange2 = high - low

    continuingPb = high < autoEntry and
         (close < close[1] or close < open or high < high[1]) and
         pullbackRange2 <= expansionRange * MAX_PULLBACK_RANGE_VS_EXP and
         volume < expansionVolume and
         retraceFrac2 >= 0 and retraceFrac2 <= MAX_PULLBACK_RETRACE_FRACTION and
         close > ema20 and close > vwap and not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0

    armedInvalidation = low <= autoStop or close < vwap or close < ema20 or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)

    if armedInvalidation
        aLastSetupEvent := "READY invalidated " + fmtTimeIST(time)
        resetToScan := true
    else if continuingPb and pullbackBars < MAX_PULLBACK_BARS
        pullbackBars += 1
        autoEntry  := high + syminfo.mintick
        autoStop   := math.min(autoStop, low - syminfo.mintick)
        autoRisk   := autoEntry - autoStop
        autoTarget := autoEntry + autoRisk * rrMultiple
        aLastPbCheckTime   := time
        aLastPbCheckReason := "QUALIFIED / refined PB"
        aLastSetupEvent    := "PB refined " + fmtTimeIST(time)
    else if bar_index - readyBar >= MAX_READY_BARS
        aLastSetupEvent := "READY expired / no trigger"
        resetToScan := true

// Live paper exits: first profit-take + structural runner.
// No pre-target trailing: initial structural risk stays intact until the first take.
// At the first take, bank a partial, move the runner stop to at least breakeven,
// then trail using completed-bar structure. This keeps initial risk fixed while
// allowing exceptional trends to earn more than a fixed 2R full exit.
if autoState == 3 and barstate.isrealtime
    if na(autoManagedStop)
        autoManagedStop := autoStop

    if autoPartialTaken and enableRunnerTrail and bar_index > autoPartialEventBar
        autoManagedStop := calcRunnerStop(autoEntry, autoManagedStop, runnerRecentLow, atr)

    qtyAExit    = not na(autoRemainingQty) ? autoRemainingQty : calcQty(autoEntry, autoStop)
    rNowA       = autoRisk > 0 ? (close - autoEntry) / autoRisk : na
    stopNow     = close <= autoManagedStop
    firstTakeNow = not autoPartialTaken and close >= autoTarget

    if stopNow
        autoState    := -1
        stopEventBar := bar_index
        terminalBar  := bar_index
        stopKindA = autoManagedStop > autoStop + syminfo.mintick ? "RUNNER / PROTECTIVE STOP" : "STOP"
        aLastExitReason := stopKindA
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / " + stopKindA + " | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | ManagedSL " + str.tostring(autoManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyAExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowA, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_STOP", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if forceExitNow
        autoState      := 4
        targetEventBar := bar_index
        terminalBar    := bar_index
        aLastExitReason := "EOD EXIT"
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / EOD SAFETY EXIT | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyAExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowA, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_EOD", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if firstTakeNow
        aTakeQty = calcPartialQty(autoInitialQty)
        if aTakeQty >= autoRemainingQty
            autoState      := 4
            targetEventBar := bar_index
            terminalBar    := bar_index
            aLastExitReason := "FIRST TAKE / FULL"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / FIRST TAKE FULL | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(autoRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowA, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_FIRST_TAKE_FULL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            autoRemainingQty := autoRemainingQty - aTakeQty
            autoPartialTaken := true
            autoPartialEventBar := bar_index
            autoManagedStop := math.max(autoManagedStop, autoEntry)
            aLastExitReason := "PARTIAL / RUNNER"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / TAKE " + str.tostring(partialExitPct, "#") + "% | Lane A | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(aTakeQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerQty " + str.tostring(autoRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerSL>= " + str.tostring(autoManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowA, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_PARTIAL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)


if resetToScan
    autoState        := 0
    expansionBar     := na
    expansionLow     := na
    expansionRange   := na
    expansionVolume  := na
    peakHigh         := na
    pullbackStartBar := na
    pullbackBars     := 0
    readyBar         := na
    autoEntry        := na
    autoStop         := na
    autoTarget       := na
    autoRisk         := na
    autoManagedStop  := na
    autoInitialQty    := na
    autoRemainingQty  := na
    autoPartialTaken  := false
    autoPartialEventBar := na
    entryEventBar    := na
    stopEventBar     := na
    targetEventBar   := na
    missedEventBar   := na
    terminalBar      := na
    aLastExitReason  := ""

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane B — Important-level breakout -> acceptance/retest -> continuation
// Separate paper hypothesis. Lane A logic above is unchanged.
// State meanings mirror Lane A:
//  0 scan, 1 breakout found/wait acceptance, 2 ready, 3 in trade,
//  4 target, -1 stop, 5 missed/no chase.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
varip float  bLevel            = na
varip string bLevelName        = ""
varip int    bBreakBar         = na
varip float  bBreakVolume      = na
varip int    bReadyBar         = na
varip float  bEntry            = na
varip float  bStop             = na
varip float  bTarget           = na
varip float  bRisk             = na
varip float  bManagedStop      = na
varip float  bInitialQty       = na
varip float  bRemainingQty     = na
varip bool   bPartialTaken     = false
varip int    bPartialEventBar  = na
varip int    bEntryEventBar    = na
varip int    bStopEventBar     = na
varip int    bTargetEventBar   = na
varip int    bMissedEventBar   = na
varip int    bTerminalBar      = na
varip string bLastExitReason   = ""
varip bool   bLiveEngineStarted = false
bool bResetToScan = false

if not symbolBuySlotOpen and bState != 3 and (bState == 1 or bState == 2)
    bResetToScan := true

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    bState           := 0
    bLevel           := na
    bLevelName       := ""
    bBreakBar        := na
    bBreakVolume     := na
    bReadyBar        := na
    bEntry           := na
    bStop            := na
    bTarget          := na
    bRisk            := na
    bManagedStop     := na
    bInitialQty      := na
    bRemainingQty    := na
    bPartialTaken    := false
    bPartialEventBar := na
    bEntryEventBar   := na
    bStopEventBar    := na
    bTargetEventBar  := na
    bMissedEventBar  := na
    bTerminalBar     := na
    bLastExitReason  := ""

if (bState == 4 or bState == -1) and not na(bTerminalBar) and bar_index - bTerminalBar >= terminalCooldownBars
    bResetToScan := true
if bState == 5 and not na(bTerminalBar) and bar_index - bTerminalBar >= missedCooldownBars
    bResetToScan := true

// At/after the entry cutoff, abandon any not-yet-entered Lane B candidate.
// A live paper trade (state 3) continues to be managed by its frozen initial risk and runner rules.
if not entryWindowOpen and (bState == 1 or bState == 2)
    bResetToScan := true

// Detect a fresh close through PDH and/or PWH. If both are crossed on the same
// bar, the higher level is used; if they coincide it is labelled PDH/PWH.
bBreakBuffer = not na(atr) ? atr * B_BREAK_BUFFER_ATR : 0.0
bool bCrossPDH = not na(pdh) and close[1] <= pdh and close > pdh + bBreakBuffer
bool bCrossPWH = not na(pwh) and close[1] <= pwh and close > pwh + bBreakBuffer
float bCandidateLevel = na
string bCandidateName = ""
if bCrossPDH and bCrossPWH
    bCandidateLevel := math.max(pdh, pwh)
    bCandidateName  := math.abs(pdh - pwh) <= syminfo.mintick ? "PDH/PWH" : (pwh > pdh ? "PWH" : "PDH")
else if bCrossPWH
    bCandidateLevel := pwh
    bCandidateName  := "PWH"
else if bCrossPDH
    bCandidateLevel := pdh
    bCandidateName  := "PDH"

bBreakoutQuality = barstate.isconfirmed and contextGood and
     not na(bCandidateLevel) and close > open and
     bodyFraction >= B_MIN_BODY_FRACTION and
     closePosition >= B_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION and
     not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio >= B_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO

if bState == 0 and symbolBuySlotOpen and entryWindowOpen and autoState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and bBreakoutQuality
    bState           := 1
    bLevel           := bCandidateLevel
    bLevelName       := bCandidateName
    bBreakBar        := bar_index
    bBreakVolume     := volume
    bReadyBar        := na
    bEntry           := na
    bStop            := na
    bTarget          := na
    bRisk            := na
    bManagedStop     := na
    bInitialQty      := na
    bRemainingQty    := na
    bPartialTaken    := false
    bPartialEventBar := na
    bEntryEventBar   := na
    bStopEventBar    := na
    bTargetEventBar  := na
    bMissedEventBar  := na
    bLastExitReason  := ""

// Acceptance/retest must occur soon after the breakout. It may be either a
// controlled touch of the broken level or a tight consolidation above it.
if bState == 1 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > bBreakBar
    bTouchTol      = atr * B_LEVEL_TOUCH_TOL_ATR
    bUndercut      = atr * B_MAX_UNDERCUT_ATR
    bMaxExtension  = atr * B_MAX_ACCEPT_EXTENSION_ATR
    bAcceptRange   = high - low

    bCloseHolds    = close >= bLevel
    bNoDeepBreak   = low >= bLevel - bUndercut
    bTouchesLevel  = low <= bLevel + bTouchTol
    bTightAbove    = low > bLevel and bAcceptRange <= atr * B_MAX_ACCEPT_RANGE_ATR
    bQuieter       = not na(bBreakVolume) and volume <= bBreakVolume
    bExtensionOk   = close >= bLevel and close - bLevel <= bMaxExtension
    bContextOk     = close > ema20 and close > vwap and not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0

    bAcceptance = bCloseHolds and bNoDeepBreak and (bTouchesLevel or bTightAbove) and bQuieter and bExtensionOk and bContextOk
    bHardInvalid = close < bLevel - bUndercut or close < vwap or close < ema20 or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)

    if bHardInvalid
        bResetToScan := true
    else if bAcceptance
        bReadyBar := bar_index
        bEntry    := high + syminfo.mintick
        bStop     := math.min(low - syminfo.mintick, bLevel - atr * 0.05)
        bRisk     := bEntry - bStop
        bTarget   := bEntry + bRisk * rrMultiple
        bState    := bRisk > 0 ? 2 : 0
        if bRisk > 0
            bReadyToday += 1
            if barstate.isrealtime and enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableSetupReadyAlerts
                alert("NG SETUP READY | Lane B " + bLevelName + " ACCEPTANCE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Trigger " + str.tostring(bEntry, format.mintick) +
                      " | SL " + str.tostring(bStop, format.mintick) +
                          " | WAIT FOR TRIGGER — NOT YET A BUY",
                      alert.freq_all)
    else if bar_index - bBreakBar >= B_MAX_BARS_TO_ACCEPT
        bResetToScan := true

// Same fresh-load protection as Lane A. Historical confirmed bullish close-through resets
// immediately and never imposes a live cooldown.
if barstate.isrealtime and not bLiveEngineStarted
    bLiveEngineStarted := true
    if freshScanOnLoad and (bState == 1 or bState == 2)
        bResetToScan := true
    else if bState == 2 and high >= bEntry
        bResetToScan := true

if bState == 2 and not barstate.isrealtime and confirmedBullishActionBar and close >= bEntry
    bResetToScan := true

if bState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and close <= bStop
    bResetToScan := true

if bState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and (autoState == 3 or cState == 3 or dState == 3 or eState == 3) and high >= bEntry
    bResetToScan := true

if bState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and symbolBuySlotOpen and confirmedBullishActionBar and entryWindowOpen and autoState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and not bResetToScan and close >= bEntry
    bEntryContextOk = close > ema20 and close > vwap and not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    bPlannedRisk    = bRisk
    bOvershootR     = bPlannedRisk > 0 ? (close - bEntry) / bPlannedRisk : 999.0
    bEntryFill      = close
    bEntryFillRisk  = bEntryFill - bStop
    bEntryQty       = calcQty(bEntryFill, bStop)

    if bEntryContextOk and bOvershootR <= B_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R and bEntryFillRisk > 0 and bEntryQty >= 1
        bEntry         := bEntryFill
        bRisk          := bEntryFillRisk
        bTarget        := bEntry + bRisk * rrMultiple
        bState         := 3
        bManagedStop   := bStop
        bInitialQty     := bEntryQty
        bRemainingQty   := bEntryQty
        bPartialTaken   := false
        bPartialEventBar := na
        bEntryEventBar  := bar_index
        bBuyToday     += 1
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER BUY NOW | Lane B " + bLevelName + " continuation | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(bEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(bStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | Qty " + str.tostring(bEntryQty, "#") +
                  " | Position ₹" + str.tostring(bEntryQty * bEntry, "#.##") +
                  " | MaxRisk ₹" + str.tostring(bEntryQty * bRisk, "#.##") +
                  " | PosCap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#.##") +
                  " | FirstTake " + str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R @ " + str.tostring(bTarget, format.mintick) +
                  " | Then RUNNER" + actionMeta("BUY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        reasonB = bEntryQty < 1 ? "QTY 0 / RISK TOO LARGE" : not bEntryContextOk ? "CONTEXT LOST" : "NO CHASE"
        bState          := 5
        bMissedEventBar := bar_index
        bTerminalBar    := bar_index
        bRejectToday   += 1
        if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableMissedAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER MISSED | Lane B " + bLevelName + " continuation | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | " + reasonB +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(bEntry, format.mintick),
                  alert.freq_all)

if bState == 2 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > bReadyBar
    bReadyInvalid = close < bLevel or close < vwap or close < ema20 or low <= bStop or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)
    if bReadyInvalid
        bResetToScan := true
    else if bar_index - bReadyBar >= B_MAX_READY_BARS
        bResetToScan := true

if bState == 3 and barstate.isrealtime
    if na(bManagedStop)
        bManagedStop := bStop

    if bPartialTaken and enableRunnerTrail and bar_index > bPartialEventBar
        bManagedStop := calcRunnerStop(bEntry, bManagedStop, runnerRecentLow, atr)

    qtyBExit     = not na(bRemainingQty) ? bRemainingQty : calcQty(bEntry, bStop)
    rNowB        = bRisk > 0 ? (close - bEntry) / bRisk : na
    bStopNow     = close <= bManagedStop
    bFirstTakeNow = not bPartialTaken and close >= bTarget

    if bStopNow
        bState        := -1
        bStopEventBar := bar_index
        bTerminalBar  := bar_index
        stopKindB = bManagedStop > bStop + syminfo.mintick ? "RUNNER / PROTECTIVE STOP" : "STOP"
        bLastExitReason := stopKindB
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / " + stopKindB + " | Lane B " + bLevelName + " continuation | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | ManagedSL " + str.tostring(bManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyBExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowB, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_STOP", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if forceExitNow
        bState          := 4
        bTargetEventBar := bar_index
        bTerminalBar    := bar_index
        bLastExitReason := "EOD EXIT"
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / EOD SAFETY EXIT | Lane B " + bLevelName + " continuation | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyBExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowB, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_EOD", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if bFirstTakeNow
        bTakeQty = calcPartialQty(bInitialQty)
        if bTakeQty >= bRemainingQty
            bState          := 4
            bTargetEventBar := bar_index
            bTerminalBar    := bar_index
            bLastExitReason := "FIRST TAKE / FULL"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / FIRST TAKE FULL | Lane B " + bLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(bRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowB, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_FIRST_TAKE_FULL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            bRemainingQty := bRemainingQty - bTakeQty
            bPartialTaken := true
            bPartialEventBar := bar_index
            bManagedStop := math.max(bManagedStop, bEntry)
            bLastExitReason := "PARTIAL / RUNNER"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / TAKE " + str.tostring(partialExitPct, "#") + "% | Lane B " + bLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(bTakeQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerQty " + str.tostring(bRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerSL>= " + str.tostring(bManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowB, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_PARTIAL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)


if bResetToScan
    bState           := 0
    bLevel           := na
    bLevelName       := ""
    bBreakBar        := na
    bBreakVolume     := na
    bReadyBar        := na
    bEntry           := na
    bStop            := na
    bTarget          := na
    bRisk            := na
    bManagedStop     := na
    bInitialQty      := na
    bRemainingQty    := na
    bPartialTaken    := false
    bPartialEventBar := na
    bEntryEventBar   := na
    bStopEventBar    := na
    bTargetEventBar  := na
    bMissedEventBar  := na
    bTerminalBar     := na
    bLastExitReason  := ""


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane C — Immediate momentum continuation
// Separate PAPER hypothesis. Lane A/B definitions above remain frozen.
// State meanings:
//  0 scan, 2 armed/ready for immediate continuation trigger, 3 in trade,
//  4 target, -1 stop, 5 missed/no chase.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
varip string cLevelName        = ""
varip float  cBreakLevel       = na
varip int    cSetupBar         = na
varip int    cReadyBar         = na
varip float  cEntry            = na
varip float  cStop             = na
varip float  cTarget           = na
varip float  cRisk             = na
varip float  cManagedStop      = na
varip float  cInitialQty       = na
varip float  cRemainingQty     = na
varip bool   cPartialTaken     = false
varip int    cPartialEventBar  = na
varip int    cEntryEventBar    = na
varip int    cStopEventBar     = na
varip int    cTargetEventBar   = na
varip int    cMissedEventBar   = na
varip int    cTerminalBar      = na
varip string cLastExitReason   = ""
varip string cLastRejectReason = "—"
varip int    cLastRejectBar    = na
varip bool   cLiveEngineStarted = false

// Lane-C0 coverage study — FORWARD MEASUREMENT ONLY.
// It is intentionally independent from cState after launch and can never set
// cState, consume the symbol BUY slot, size a live trade, or emit an actionable
// BUY/SELL. The study starts only from an EXISTING Lane-C fully-qualified arm.
varip bool   c0StudyActive        = false
varip bool   c0StudyDone          = false
varip int    c0StudyEntryBar      = na
varip int    c0StudyEntryTime     = na
varip float  c0StudyEntry         = na
varip float  c0StudyStop          = na
varip float  c0StudyRisk          = na
varip float  c0StudyQty           = na
varip float  c0StudyT1            = na
varip float  c0StudyT2            = na
varip float  c0StudyT3            = na
varip float  c0StudyHighest       = na
varip float  c0StudyLowest        = na
varip bool   c0StudyT1Hit         = false
varip bool   c0StudyT2Hit         = false
varip bool   c0StudyT3Hit         = false
varip bool   c0StudyStopHit       = false
varip int    c0StudyT1Time        = na
varip int    c0StudyT2Time        = na
varip int    c0StudyT3Time        = na
varip int    c0StudyStopTime      = na
varip string c0StudyEndReason     = "—"
varip string c0StudyLastSummary   = "—"
varip int    c0StudyResultEventBar = na
varip int    cCoverageAlertBar    = na

bool cResetToScan = false

if not symbolBuySlotOpen and cState != 3 and (cState == 1 or cState == 2)
    cResetToScan := true

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    cState           := 0
    cLevelName       := ""
    cBreakLevel      := na
    cSetupBar        := na
    cReadyBar        := na
    cEntry           := na
    cStop            := na
    cTarget          := na
    cRisk            := na
    cManagedStop     := na
    cInitialQty      := na
    cRemainingQty    := na
    cPartialTaken    := false
    cPartialEventBar := na
    cEntryEventBar   := na
    cStopEventBar    := na
    cTargetEventBar  := na
    cMissedEventBar  := na
    cTerminalBar     := na
    cLastExitReason  := ""
    cLastRejectReason := "—"
    cLastRejectBar    := na
    c0StudyActive         := false
    c0StudyDone           := false
    c0StudyEntryBar       := na
    c0StudyEntryTime      := na
    c0StudyEntry          := na
    c0StudyStop           := na
    c0StudyRisk           := na
    c0StudyQty            := na
    c0StudyT1             := na
    c0StudyT2             := na
    c0StudyT3             := na
    c0StudyHighest        := na
    c0StudyLowest         := na
    c0StudyT1Hit          := false
    c0StudyT2Hit          := false
    c0StudyT3Hit          := false
    c0StudyStopHit        := false
    c0StudyT1Time         := na
    c0StudyT2Time         := na
    c0StudyT3Time         := na
    c0StudyStopTime       := na
    c0StudyEndReason      := "—"
    c0StudyLastSummary    := "—"
    c0StudyResultEventBar := na
    cCoverageAlertBar     := na

if (cState == 4 or cState == -1) and not na(cTerminalBar) and bar_index - cTerminalBar >= terminalCooldownBars
    cResetToScan := true
if cState == 5 and not na(cTerminalBar) and bar_index - cTerminalBar >= missedCooldownBars
    cResetToScan := true

// At/after the entry cutoff, abandon an untriggered Lane C setup.
// A live paper trade continues to be managed by its frozen initial risk and runner rules.
if not entryWindowOpen and cState == 2
    cResetToScan := true

// Tag the strongest freshly broken reference available on the momentum bar.
// Lane C does not REQUIRE PDH/PWH; a fresh 8-bar high can qualify.
// If a higher-timeframe level is crossed on the same bar, it is named explicitly.
bool cCrossPDH = not na(pdh) and close[1] <= pdh and close > pdh
bool cCrossPWH = not na(pwh) and close[1] <= pwh and close > pwh

float cCandidateLevel = priorHigh
string cCandidateName = "8-bar high"

if cCrossPDH and cCrossPWH
    cCandidateLevel := math.max(priorHigh, math.max(pdh, pwh))
    cCandidateName  := math.abs(pdh - pwh) <= syminfo.mintick ? "PDH/PWH" : (pwh > pdh ? "PWH" : "PDH")
else if cCrossPWH
    cCandidateLevel := math.max(priorHigh, pwh)
    cCandidateName  := "PWH"
else if cCrossPDH
    cCandidateLevel := math.max(priorHigh, pdh)
    cCandidateName  := "PDH"

// Lane C uses a stricter momentum bar than Lane A because it is willing to
// enter continuation without waiting for a controlled pullback.
cEmaExtensionAtr = not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? (close - ema20) / atr : na
cMomentumQuality = barstate.isconfirmed and entryWindowOpen and contextGood and
     close > open and
     not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh and
     not na(atr) and atr > 0 and
     barRange >= atr * C_MIN_RANGE_ATR and
     bodyFraction >= C_MIN_BODY_FRACTION and
     closePosition >= C_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION and
     not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio >= C_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= C_MIN_RS_PCT and
     not na(cEmaExtensionAtr) and cEmaExtensionAtr <= C_MAX_CLOSE_ABOVE_EMA_ATR

// Remember the reason on the actual momentum-attempt bar rather than later
// reporting only the current candle's blocker.
cAttemptBar = barstate.isconfirmed and entryWindowOpen and contextGood and close > open and not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh
if cState == 0 and cAttemptBar
    cLastRejectReason := na(atr) or atr <= 0 ? "ATR unavailable" :
         barRange < atr * C_MIN_RANGE_ATR ? "Range < 1.0 ATR" :
         bodyFraction < C_MIN_BODY_FRACTION ? "Body < 65%" :
         closePosition < C_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION ? "Close < top 25%" :
         na(completedBarVolRatio) or completedBarVolRatio < C_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO ? "Volume < 2.0x" :
         na(rsSpreadPct) or rsSpreadPct < C_MIN_RS_PCT ? "Intraday RS < 1.0%" :
         na(cEmaExtensionAtr) or cEmaExtensionAtr > C_MAX_CLOSE_ABOVE_EMA_ATR ? "Too extended from EMA" :
         "Momentum bar passed"
    cLastRejectBar := bar_index

if cState == 0 and symbolBuySlotOpen and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and cMomentumQuality
    cEntryCandidate = high + syminfo.mintick
    cMidpoint       = low + barRange * 0.50
    cStopCandidate  = math.max(cMidpoint - syminfo.mintick, cCandidateLevel - atr * C_STOP_BUFFER_ATR)
    cRiskCandidate  = cEntryCandidate - cStopCandidate

    // If another known HTF resistance remains above the proposed entry,
    // require at least 1R of room to it. If no known PDH/PWH is above, pass.
    float cNextResistance = na
    if not na(pdh) and pdh > cEntryCandidate
        cNextResistance := pdh
    if not na(pwh) and pwh > cEntryCandidate
        cNextResistance := na(cNextResistance) ? pwh : math.min(cNextResistance, pwh)

    cRiskOk = cRiskCandidate > 0 and cRiskCandidate <= atr * C_MAX_RISK_ATR
    cRoomOk = na(cNextResistance) or (cNextResistance - cEntryCandidate) >= cRiskCandidate * C_MIN_ROOM_R

    if cRiskOk and cRoomOk
        cLastRejectReason := "QUALIFIED / ARMED"
        cLastRejectBar    := bar_index

        // C0 research launch: same EXISTING qualification, different timing only.
        // Forward-only so the 1/2/3% vs stop event order is observed tick-by-tick,
        // not inferred from historical OHLC ordering.
        if enableC0ShadowStudy and barstate.isrealtime and not c0StudyActive
            float c0EntryCandidate = close
            float c0RiskCandidate  = c0EntryCandidate - cStopCandidate
            float c0QtyCandidate   = calcQty(c0EntryCandidate, cStopCandidate)
            if c0RiskCandidate > 0 and c0QtyCandidate >= 1
                c0StudyActive         := true
                c0StudyDone           := false
                c0StudyEntryBar       := bar_index
                c0StudyEntryTime      := time_close
                c0StudyEntry          := c0EntryCandidate
                c0StudyStop           := cStopCandidate
                c0StudyRisk           := c0RiskCandidate
                c0StudyQty            := c0QtyCandidate
                c0StudyT1             := c0StudyEntry * (1.0 + C0_STUDY_T1_PCT / 100.0)
                c0StudyT2             := c0StudyEntry * (1.0 + C0_STUDY_T2_PCT / 100.0)
                c0StudyT3             := c0StudyEntry * (1.0 + C0_STUDY_T3_PCT / 100.0)
                c0StudyHighest        := c0StudyEntry
                c0StudyLowest         := c0StudyEntry
                c0StudyT1Hit          := false
                c0StudyT2Hit          := false
                c0StudyT3Hit          := false
                c0StudyStopHit        := false
                c0StudyT1Time         := na
                c0StudyT2Time         := na
                c0StudyT3Time         := na
                c0StudyStopTime       := na
                c0StudyEndReason      := "RUNNING"
                c0StudyLastSummary    := "RUNNING"
                c0StudyResultEventBar := na

        cState          := 2
        cReadyToday    += 1
        cLevelName      := cCandidateName
        cBreakLevel     := cCandidateLevel
        cSetupBar       := bar_index
        cReadyBar       := bar_index
        cEntry          := cEntryCandidate
        cStop           := cStopCandidate
        cRisk           := cRiskCandidate
        cTarget         := cEntry + cRisk * rrMultiple
        cEntryEventBar  := na
        cStopEventBar   := na
        cTargetEventBar := na
        cMissedEventBar := na
        cLastExitReason := ""
        if barstate.isrealtime and enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableSetupReadyAlerts
            alert("NG SETUP READY | Lane C IMMEDIATE MOMENTUM | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Level " + cLevelName +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(cEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(cStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | WAIT FOR TRIGGER — NOT YET A BUY",
                  alert.freq_all)
    else
        cLastRejectReason := not cRiskOk ? "Risk > 0.90 ATR" : "Not enough room to resistance"
        cLastRejectBar    := bar_index

// Optional confirmed Fast-Mover coverage telemetry. Research only; OFF by
// default. This deliberately probes bars that fail before cAttemptBar too, so
// "no breakout", candle quality, context and extension misses are measurable.
bool cCoverageProbeBar = barstate.isconfirmed and entryWindowOpen and fastMoverCore
if enablePineAlerts and enableCCoverageResearchAlerts and barstate.isrealtime and cCoverageProbeBar and (na(cCoverageAlertBar) or cCoverageAlertBar != bar_index)
    string cCoverageOutcome = cState == 2 and cReadyBar == bar_index ? "ARMED" :
         not contextGood ? "CONTEXT BLOCK" :
         close <= open ? "Need bullish close" :
         na(priorHigh) or close <= priorHigh ? "No 8-bar breakout" :
         na(atr) or atr <= 0 ? "ATR unavailable" :
         barRange < atr * C_MIN_RANGE_ATR ? "Range < 1.0 ATR" :
         bodyFraction < C_MIN_BODY_FRACTION ? "Body < 65%" :
         closePosition < C_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION ? "Close < top 25%" :
         na(completedBarVolRatio) or completedBarVolRatio < C_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO ? "Volume < 2.0x" :
         na(rsSpreadPct) or rsSpreadPct < C_MIN_RS_PCT ? "Intraday RS < 1.0%" :
         na(cEmaExtensionAtr) or cEmaExtensionAtr > C_MAX_CLOSE_ABOVE_EMA_ATR ? "Too extended from EMA" :
         not na(cLastRejectBar) and cLastRejectBar == bar_index ? cLastRejectReason : "Momentum passed / arm blocked"
    alert("NG RESEARCH C COVERAGE | " + syminfo.ticker +
          " | Outcome " + cCoverageOutcome +
          " | ExtEMA " + (na(cEmaExtensionAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(cEmaExtensionAtr, "#.##") + "ATR") +
          " | Range " + (na(atr) or atr <= 0 ? "—" : str.tostring(barRange / atr, "#.##") + "ATR") +
          " | Body " + str.tostring(bodyFraction * 100.0, "#.#") + "%" +
          " | ClosePos " + str.tostring(closePosition * 100.0, "#.#") + "%" +
          " | Vol " + (na(completedBarVolRatio) ? "—" : str.tostring(completedBarVolRatio, "#.##") + "x") +
          " | IntraRS " + (na(rsSpreadPct) ? "—" : str.tostring(rsSpreadPct, "#.##") + "%") +
          " | AState " + str.tostring(autoState) +
          " | DState " + str.tostring(dState) +
          actionMeta("RESEARCH_C_COVERAGE", time),
          alert.freq_all)
    cCoverageAlertBar := bar_index

// Same fresh-load protection as the other lanes.
if barstate.isrealtime and not cLiveEngineStarted
    cLiveEngineStarted := true
    if freshScanOnLoad and cState == 2
        cResetToScan := true
    else if cState == 2 and high >= cEntry
        cResetToScan := true

// Historical confirmed bullish close-through consumes READY; no wick-only touch resets
// the setup or leaks a historical cooldown into the current live scan.
if cState == 2 and not barstate.isrealtime and bar_index > cSetupBar and confirmedBullishActionBar and close >= cEntry
    cResetToScan := true

// Before entry, a loss of the continuation structure invalidates the setup.
if cState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and close <= cStop
    cResetToScan := true

// If another lane owns the paper position when Lane C's trigger trades, the
// continuation setup is no longer a valid first trigger.
if cState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and (autoState == 3 or bState == 3 or dState == 3 or eState == 3) and high >= cEntry
    cResetToScan := true

// Immediate continuation trigger. Require valid sizing as well as context.
if cState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and symbolBuySlotOpen and confirmedBullishActionBar and entryWindowOpen and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and dState != 3 and eState != 3 and not cResetToScan and close >= cEntry
    cEntryContextOk = close > ema20 and close > vwap and not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    cPlannedRisk    = cRisk
    cOvershootR     = cPlannedRisk > 0 ? (close - cEntry) / cPlannedRisk : 999.0
    cEntryFill      = close
    cEntryFillRisk  = cEntryFill - cStop
    cEntryQty       = calcQty(cEntryFill, cStop)

    if cEntryContextOk and cOvershootR <= C_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R and cEntryFillRisk > 0 and cEntryQty >= 1
        cEntry         := cEntryFill
        cRisk          := cEntryFillRisk
        cTarget        := cEntry + cRisk * rrMultiple
        cState         := 3
        cManagedStop   := cStop
        cInitialQty     := cEntryQty
        cRemainingQty   := cEntryQty
        cPartialTaken   := false
        cPartialEventBar := na
        cEntryEventBar  := bar_index
        cBuyToday     += 1
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER BUY NOW | Lane C Immediate Momentum " + cLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(cEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(cStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | Qty " + str.tostring(cEntryQty, "#") +
                  " | Position ₹" + str.tostring(cEntryQty * cEntry, "#.##") +
                  " | MaxRisk ₹" + str.tostring(cEntryQty * cRisk, "#.##") +
                  " | PosCap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#.##") +
                  " | FirstTake " + str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R @ " + str.tostring(cTarget, format.mintick) +
                  " | Then RUNNER" + actionMeta("BUY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        reasonC = cEntryQty < 1 ? "QTY 0 / RISK TOO LARGE" : not cEntryContextOk ? "CONTEXT LOST" : "NO CHASE"
        cState          := 5
        cMissedEventBar := bar_index
        cTerminalBar    := bar_index
        cRejectToday   += 1
        cLastRejectReason := "TRIGGER " + reasonC
        if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableMissedAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER MISSED | Lane C Immediate Momentum " + cLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | " + reasonC +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(cEntry, format.mintick),
                  alert.freq_all)

// Lane C is intentionally short-lived: if momentum does not continue through
// the expansion high within two bars, the immediate-momentum hypothesis expires.
if cState == 2 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > cSetupBar
    cReadyInvalid = close < cBreakLevel or close < vwap or close < ema20 or low <= cStop or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)
    if cReadyInvalid
        cResetToScan := true
    else if bar_index - cSetupBar >= C_MAX_TRIGGER_BARS
        cResetToScan := true

if cState == 3 and barstate.isrealtime
    if na(cManagedStop)
        cManagedStop := cStop

    if cPartialTaken and enableRunnerTrail and bar_index > cPartialEventBar
        cManagedStop := calcRunnerStop(cEntry, cManagedStop, runnerRecentLow, atr)

    qtyCExit     = not na(cRemainingQty) ? cRemainingQty : calcQty(cEntry, cStop)
    rNowC        = cRisk > 0 ? (close - cEntry) / cRisk : na
    cStopNow     = close <= cManagedStop
    cFirstTakeNow = not cPartialTaken and close >= cTarget

    if cStopNow
        cState        := -1
        cStopEventBar := bar_index
        cTerminalBar  := bar_index
        stopKindC = cManagedStop > cStop + syminfo.mintick ? "RUNNER / PROTECTIVE STOP" : "STOP"
        cLastExitReason := stopKindC
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / " + stopKindC + " | Lane C Immediate Momentum " + cLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | ManagedSL " + str.tostring(cManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyCExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowC, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_STOP", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if forceExitNow
        cState          := 4
        cTargetEventBar := bar_index
        cTerminalBar    := bar_index
        cLastExitReason := "EOD EXIT"
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / EOD SAFETY EXIT | Lane C Immediate Momentum " + cLevelName + " | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyCExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowC, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_EOD", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if cFirstTakeNow
        cTakeQty = calcPartialQty(cInitialQty)
        if cTakeQty >= cRemainingQty
            cState          := 4
            cTargetEventBar := bar_index
            cTerminalBar    := bar_index
            cLastExitReason := "FIRST TAKE / FULL"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / FIRST TAKE FULL | Lane C | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(cRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowC, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_FIRST_TAKE_FULL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            cRemainingQty := cRemainingQty - cTakeQty
            cPartialTaken := true
            cPartialEventBar := bar_index
            cManagedStop := math.max(cManagedStop, cEntry)
            cLastExitReason := "PARTIAL / RUNNER"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / TAKE " + str.tostring(partialExitPct, "#") + "% | Lane C | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(cTakeQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerQty " + str.tostring(cRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerSL>= " + str.tostring(cManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowC, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_PARTIAL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)


if cResetToScan
    cState           := 0
    cLevelName       := ""
    cBreakLevel      := na
    cSetupBar        := na
    cReadyBar        := na
    cEntry           := na
    cStop            := na
    cTarget          := na
    cRisk            := na
    cManagedStop     := na
    cInitialQty      := na
    cRemainingQty    := na
    cPartialTaken    := false
    cPartialEventBar := na
    cEntryEventBar   := na
    cStopEventBar    := na
    cTargetEventBar  := na
    cMissedEventBar  := na
    cTerminalBar     := na
    cLastExitReason  := ""

// Lane-C0 coverage tracker — MEASUREMENT ONLY.
// The qualifying bar itself is excluded because the shadow entry is its close;
// only subsequent realtime ticks can hit the research stop/targets.
if enableC0ShadowStudy and c0StudyActive and barstate.isrealtime
    bool c0PostEntry = not na(c0StudyEntryBar) and bar_index > c0StudyEntryBar

    if c0PostEntry
        c0StudyHighest := na(c0StudyHighest) ? close : math.max(c0StudyHighest, close)
        c0StudyLowest  := na(c0StudyLowest)  ? close : math.min(c0StudyLowest, close)

        if not c0StudyT1Hit and not na(c0StudyT1) and close >= c0StudyT1
            c0StudyT1Hit  := true
            c0StudyT1Time := timenow

        if not c0StudyT2Hit and not na(c0StudyT2) and close >= c0StudyT2
            c0StudyT2Hit  := true
            c0StudyT2Time := timenow

        if not c0StudyT3Hit and not na(c0StudyT3) and close >= c0StudyT3
            c0StudyT3Hit  := true
            c0StudyT3Time := timenow

        if not c0StudyStopHit and not na(c0StudyStop) and close <= c0StudyStop
            c0StudyStopHit  := true
            c0StudyStopTime := timenow

    bool c0FinishStop = c0PostEntry and c0StudyStopHit
    bool c0FinishT3   = c0PostEntry and c0StudyT3Hit
    bool c0FinishEod  = forceExitNow

    if (c0FinishStop or c0FinishT3 or c0FinishEod) and (na(c0StudyResultEventBar) or c0StudyResultEventBar != bar_index)
        float c0MfePct = not na(c0StudyHighest) and c0StudyEntry > 0 ? (c0StudyHighest / c0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float c0MaePct = not na(c0StudyLowest) and c0StudyEntry > 0 ? (c0StudyLowest / c0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float c0StopPct = c0StudyEntry > 0 and not na(c0StudyStop) ? (c0StudyStop / c0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float c0T1Min = not na(c0StudyT1Time) and not na(c0StudyEntryTime) ? (c0StudyT1Time - c0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float c0T2Min = not na(c0StudyT2Time) and not na(c0StudyEntryTime) ? (c0StudyT2Time - c0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float c0T3Min = not na(c0StudyT3Time) and not na(c0StudyEntryTime) ? (c0StudyT3Time - c0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        bool c0T1BeforeStop = c0StudyT1Hit and (not c0StudyStopHit or c0StudyT1Time < c0StudyStopTime)
        bool c0T2BeforeStop = c0StudyT2Hit and (not c0StudyStopHit or c0StudyT2Time < c0StudyStopTime)
        bool c0T3BeforeStop = c0StudyT3Hit and (not c0StudyStopHit or c0StudyT3Time < c0StudyStopTime)

        c0StudyEndReason := c0FinishStop ? "STOP" : c0FinishT3 ? "+3%" : "EOD"
        c0StudyLastSummary := "End " + c0StudyEndReason +
             " | +1 " + (c0T1BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO") +
             " | +2 " + (c0T2BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO") +
             " | +3 " + (c0T3BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO")
        c0StudyResultEventBar := bar_index
        c0StudyDone   := true
        c0StudyActive := false

        if enablePineAlerts and enableCCoverageResearchAlerts
            alert("NG RESEARCH C0 RESULT | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(c0StudyEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | Stop " + str.tostring(c0StudyStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | StopPct " + (na(c0StopPct) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0StopPct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | Qty " + (na(c0StudyQty) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0StudyQty, "#")) +
                  " | End " + c0StudyEndReason +
                  " | T1BeforeStop " + (c0T1BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T2BeforeStop " + (c0T2BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T3BeforeStop " + (c0T3BeforeStop ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T1Min " + (na(c0T1Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0T1Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | T2Min " + (na(c0T2Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0T2Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | T3Min " + (na(c0T3Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0T3Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | MFE " + (na(c0MfePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0MfePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | MAE " + (na(c0MaePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(c0MaePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  actionMeta("RESEARCH_C0_RESULT", time),
                  alert.freq_all)

// Hidden research levels for Data Window inspection only.
plot(enableC0ShadowStudy and (c0StudyActive or c0StudyDone) ? c0StudyEntry : na, title="C0 Study Entry", color=color.new(color.blue, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableC0ShadowStudy and (c0StudyActive or c0StudyDone) ? c0StudyStop  : na, title="C0 Study Stop",  color=color.new(color.red, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableC0ShadowStudy and (c0StudyActive or c0StudyDone) ? c0StudyT1    : na, title="C0 Study +1%",   color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableC0ShadowStudy and (c0StudyActive or c0StudyDone) ? c0StudyT2    : na, title="C0 Study +2%",   color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableC0ShadowStudy and (c0StudyActive or c0StudyDone) ? c0StudyT3    : na, title="C0 Study +3%",   color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane D — Opening Drive / Fast Mover continuation
// State: 0 scan, 1 impulse found/wait micro-pause, 2 ready, 3 in trade,
//        4 target/EOD exit, -1 stop, 5 missed/no chase.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
varip int    dImpulseBar       = na
varip float  dImpulseLow       = na
varip float  dImpulseHigh      = na
varip float  dImpulseRange     = na
varip float  dImpulseVolume    = na
varip int    dReadyBar         = na
varip float  dEntry            = na
varip float  dStop             = na
varip float  dTarget           = na
varip float  dRisk             = na
varip float  dManagedStop      = na
varip float  dInitialQty       = na
varip float  dRemainingQty     = na
varip bool   dPartialTaken     = false
varip int    dPartialEventBar  = na
varip int    dEntryEventBar    = na
varip int    dStopEventBar     = na
varip int    dTargetEventBar   = na
varip int    dMissedEventBar   = na
varip int    dTerminalBar      = na
varip string dLastExitReason   = ""
varip string dLastRejectReason = "—"
varip int    dLastRejectBar    = na
varip bool   dLiveEngineStarted = false
bool dResetToScan = false

if not symbolBuySlotOpen and dState != 3 and (dState == 1 or dState == 2)
    dResetToScan := true

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    dState            := 0
    dImpulseBar       := na
    dImpulseLow       := na
    dImpulseHigh      := na
    dImpulseRange     := na
    dImpulseVolume    := na
    dReadyBar         := na
    dEntry            := na
    dStop             := na
    dTarget           := na
    dRisk             := na
    dManagedStop      := na
    dInitialQty       := na
    dRemainingQty     := na
    dPartialTaken     := false
    dPartialEventBar  := na
    dEntryEventBar    := na
    dStopEventBar     := na
    dTargetEventBar   := na
    dMissedEventBar   := na
    dTerminalBar      := na
    dLastExitReason   := ""
    dLastRejectReason := "—"
    dLastRejectBar    := na

// Parallel monitoring: Lane D may form while legacy A/B/C are WAITING or READY.
// The one-position rule still guarantees only one live paper trade. A/B/C are
// evaluated earlier in the script, so an exact same-update collision naturally
// resolves to the legacy lane; if Lane D triggers earlier, Lane D may enter first.
legacySetupActive = autoState == 1 or autoState == 2 or bState == 1 or bState == 2 or cState == 2

if (dState == 4 or dState == -1) and not na(dTerminalBar) and bar_index - dTerminalBar >= terminalCooldownBars
    dResetToScan := true
if dState == 5 and not na(dTerminalBar) and bar_index - dTerminalBar >= missedCooldownBars
    dResetToScan := true

if (not dWindowOpen) and (dState == 1 or dState == 2)
    dResetToScan := true

dImpulseQuality = enableLaneD and barstate.isconfirmed and dWindowOpen and
     fastMoverCore and close > open and
     not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh and
     not na(atr) and atr > 0 and
     barRange >= atr * D_MIN_IMPULSE_RANGE_ATR and
     bodyFraction >= D_MIN_IMPULSE_BODY_FRACTION and
     closePosition >= D_MIN_IMPULSE_CLOSE_POSITION and
     not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio >= D_MIN_COMPLETED_VOL_RATIO

// Record why a fast-mover breakout was not eligible for Lane D.
dAttemptBar = enableLaneD and barstate.isconfirmed and dWindowOpen and fastMoverCore and close > open and not na(priorHigh) and close > priorHigh
if dState == 0 and dAttemptBar
    dLastRejectReason := na(atr) or atr <= 0 ? "ATR unavailable" :
         barRange < atr * D_MIN_IMPULSE_RANGE_ATR ? "Impulse range < 0.75 ATR" :
         bodyFraction < D_MIN_IMPULSE_BODY_FRACTION ? "Impulse body < 50%" :
         closePosition < D_MIN_IMPULSE_CLOSE_POSITION ? "Impulse close weak" :
         na(completedBarVolRatio) or completedBarVolRatio < D_MIN_COMPLETED_VOL_RATIO ? "Completed vol < 1.5x" :
         "Impulse passed"
    dLastRejectBar := bar_index

if dState == 0 and symbolBuySlotOpen and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and eState != 3 and dImpulseQuality
    dState            := 1
    dImpulseBar       := bar_index
    dImpulseLow       := low
    dImpulseHigh      := high
    dImpulseRange     := barRange
    dImpulseVolume    := volume
    dReadyBar         := na
    dEntry            := na
    dStop             := na
    dTarget           := na
    dRisk             := na
    dManagedStop      := na
    dInitialQty       := na
    dRemainingQty     := na
    dPartialTaken     := false
    dPartialEventBar  := na
    dEntryEventBar    := na
    dStopEventBar     := na
    dTargetEventBar   := na
    dMissedEventBar   := na
    dLastExitReason   := ""
    dLastRejectReason := "WAIT MICRO-PAUSE"

// Wait for a brief, controlled pause rather than a full Lane-A pullback.
// It can be a small red/green inside-type candle, but it must preserve trend.
if dState == 1 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > dImpulseBar
    dImpulseHigh := math.max(dImpulseHigh, high)
    dImpulseHeight = dImpulseHigh - dImpulseLow
    dPauseRange     = high - low
    dRetraceFrac    = dImpulseHeight > 0 ? (dImpulseHigh - low) / dImpulseHeight : 1.0
    dPauseContext   = close > ema20 and fastVwapOk and liquidityOk and
         not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
         not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    dPauseQuieter   = not na(dImpulseVolume) and volume <= dImpulseVolume * 1.20
    dPauseShape     = dPauseRange <= dImpulseRange * D_MAX_PAUSE_RANGE_VS_IMPULSE
    dPauseRetraceOk = dRetraceFrac >= 0 and dRetraceFrac <= D_MAX_PAUSE_RETRACE
    dMicroPause     = dPauseContext and dPauseQuieter and dPauseShape and dPauseRetraceOk and low > dImpulseLow

    dHardInvalid = close < vwap - vwapTol or close < ema20 or low <= dImpulseLow or
         not liquidityOk or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)

    if dHardInvalid
        dLastRejectReason := "Opening drive structure lost"
        dResetToScan := true
    else if dMicroPause
        dEntryCandidate = high + syminfo.mintick
        dStopCandidate  = low - math.max(syminfo.mintick, atr * D_STOP_BUFFER_ATR)
        dRiskCandidate  = dEntryCandidate - dStopCandidate
        dQtyCandidate   = calcQty(dEntryCandidate, dStopCandidate)
        dEntryExtensionAtr = not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? (dEntryCandidate - ema20) / atr : na
        dRiskOk         = dRiskCandidate > 0 and dRiskCandidate <= atr * D_MAX_RISK_ATR
        dExtensionOk    = not na(dEntryExtensionAtr) and dEntryExtensionAtr <= D_MAX_EXTENSION_ATR
        if dRiskOk and dExtensionOk and dQtyCandidate >= 1
            dReadyBar         := bar_index
            dEntry            := dEntryCandidate
            dStop             := dStopCandidate
            dRisk             := dRiskCandidate
            dTarget           := dEntry + dRisk * rrMultiple
            dState            := 2
            dReadyToday      += 1
            dLastRejectReason := "READY / MICRO-PAUSE"
            if barstate.isrealtime and enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableSetupReadyAlerts
                alert("NG SETUP READY | Lane D OPENING DRIVE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Trigger " + str.tostring(dEntry, format.mintick) +
                      " | SL " + str.tostring(dStop, format.mintick) +
                          (D_REQUIRE_VWAP_RECLAIM and not aboveVWAP ? " | WAIT VWAP RECLAIM" : " | WAIT FOR TRIGGER") +
                      " — NOT YET A BUY",
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            dLastRejectReason := dQtyCandidate < 1 ? "QTY 0 / risk too large" :
                 not dRiskOk ? "Pause risk > 1.10 ATR" :
                 "Entry too extended from EMA"
            dResetToScan := true
    else if bar_index - dImpulseBar >= D_MAX_BARS_TO_PAUSE
        dLastRejectReason := "No safe micro-pause"
        dResetToScan := true

// Fresh-load protection and confirmed-close historical trigger handling.
if barstate.isrealtime and not dLiveEngineStarted
    dLiveEngineStarted := true
    if freshScanOnLoad and (dState == 1 or dState == 2)
        dResetToScan := true
    else if dState == 2 and high >= dEntry
        dResetToScan := true

if dState == 2 and not barstate.isrealtime and confirmedBullishActionBar and close >= dEntry
    dResetToScan := true

if dState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and close <= dStop
    dResetToScan := true

if dState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and (autoState == 3 or bState == 3 or cState == 3 or eState == 3) and high >= dEntry
    dLastRejectReason := "Trigger occurred while another lane owned trade"
    dResetToScan := true

if dState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and symbolBuySlotOpen and confirmedBullishActionBar and dWindowOpen and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and eState != 3 and not dResetToScan and close >= dEntry
    dVwapEntryOk = D_REQUIRE_VWAP_RECLAIM ? close > vwap : fastVwapOk
    dBaseEntryContextOk = close > ema20 and liquidityOk and
         not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
         not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
    dPlannedRisk = dRisk
    dOvershootR = dPlannedRisk > 0 ? (close - dEntry) / dPlannedRisk : 999.0
    dEntryFill = close
    dEntryFillRisk = dEntryFill - dStop
    dEntryQty   = calcQty(dEntryFill, dStop)

    // If the micro-pause trigger trades while price is only marginally under
    // VWAP, do not throw the setup away. Keep it READY and require the reclaim.
    if dBaseEntryContextOk and not dVwapEntryOk and D_REQUIRE_VWAP_RECLAIM and dOvershootR <= D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R
        dLastRejectReason := "Trigger touched / waiting VWAP reclaim"
    else if dBaseEntryContextOk and dVwapEntryOk and dOvershootR <= D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R and dEntryFillRisk > 0 and dEntryQty >= 1
        dEntry         := dEntryFill
        dRisk          := dEntryFillRisk
        dTarget        := dEntry + dRisk * rrMultiple
        dState         := 3
        dManagedStop   := dStop
        dInitialQty     := dEntryQty
        dRemainingQty   := dEntryQty
        dPartialTaken   := false
        dPartialEventBar := na
        dEntryEventBar  := bar_index
        dBuyToday     += 1
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER BUY NOW | Lane D OPENING DRIVE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Day " + str.tostring(stockDayPct, "#.##") + "%" +
                  " | DayRS " + str.tostring(dayRsPct, "#.##") + "%" +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(dEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(dStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | Qty " + str.tostring(dEntryQty, "#") +
                  " | Position ₹" + str.tostring(dEntryQty * dEntry, "#.##") +
                  " | MaxRisk ₹" + str.tostring(dEntryQty * dRisk, "#.##") +
                  " | PosCap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#.##") +
                  " | FirstTake " + str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R @ " + str.tostring(dTarget, format.mintick) +
                  " | Then RUNNER" + actionMeta("BUY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        dState          := 5
        dMissedEventBar := bar_index
        dTerminalBar    := bar_index
        dRejectToday   += 1
        dLastRejectReason := dEntryQty < 1 ? "QTY 0 / RISK TOO LARGE" :
             not dBaseEntryContextOk ? "CONTEXT LOST" :
             dOvershootR > D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R ? "NO CHASE" :
             "VWAP RECLAIM FAILED"
        if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableMissedAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER MISSED | Lane D OPENING DRIVE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | " + dLastRejectReason +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(dEntry, format.mintick),
                  alert.freq_all)

if dState == 2 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > dReadyBar
    dReadyInvalid = close < ema20 or close < vwap - vwapTol or low <= dStop or not liquidityOk or (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)
    if dReadyInvalid
        dLastRejectReason := "Ready setup invalidated"
        dResetToScan := true
    else if bar_index - dReadyBar >= D_MAX_READY_BARS
        dLastRejectReason := "Ready setup expired"
        dResetToScan := true

if dState == 3 and barstate.isrealtime
    if na(dManagedStop)
        dManagedStop := dStop

    if dPartialTaken and enableRunnerTrail and bar_index > dPartialEventBar
        dManagedStop := calcRunnerStop(dEntry, dManagedStop, runnerRecentLow, atr)

    qtyDExit     = not na(dRemainingQty) ? dRemainingQty : calcQty(dEntry, dStop)
    rNowD        = dRisk > 0 ? (close - dEntry) / dRisk : na
    dStopNow     = close <= dManagedStop
    dFirstTakeNow = not dPartialTaken and close >= dTarget

    if dStopNow
        dState        := -1
        dStopEventBar := bar_index
        dTerminalBar  := bar_index
        stopKindD = dManagedStop > dStop + syminfo.mintick ? "RUNNER / PROTECTIVE STOP" : "STOP"
        dLastExitReason := stopKindD
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / " + stopKindD + " | Lane D OPENING DRIVE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | ManagedSL " + str.tostring(dManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyDExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowD, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_STOP", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if forceExitNow
        dState          := 4
        dTargetEventBar := bar_index
        dTerminalBar    := bar_index
        dLastExitReason := "EOD EXIT"
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / EOD SAFETY EXIT | Lane D OPENING DRIVE | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyDExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowD, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_EOD", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if dFirstTakeNow
        dTakeQty = calcPartialQty(dInitialQty)
        if dTakeQty >= dRemainingQty
            dState          := 4
            dTargetEventBar := bar_index
            dTerminalBar    := bar_index
            dLastExitReason := "FIRST TAKE / FULL"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / FIRST TAKE FULL | Lane D | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(dRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowD, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_FIRST_TAKE_FULL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            dRemainingQty := dRemainingQty - dTakeQty
            dPartialTaken := true
            dPartialEventBar := bar_index
            dManagedStop := math.max(dManagedStop, dEntry)
            dLastExitReason := "PARTIAL / RUNNER"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / TAKE " + str.tostring(partialExitPct, "#") + "% | Lane D | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(dTakeQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerQty " + str.tostring(dRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerSL>= " + str.tostring(dManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowD, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_PARTIAL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)


if dResetToScan
    dState           := 0
    dImpulseBar      := na
    dImpulseLow      := na
    dImpulseHigh     := na
    dImpulseRange    := na
    dImpulseVolume   := na
    dReadyBar        := na
    dEntry           := na
    dStop            := na
    dTarget          := na
    dRisk            := na
    dManagedStop     := na
    dInitialQty      := na
    dRemainingQty    := na
    dPartialTaken    := false
    dPartialEventBar := na
    dEntryEventBar   := na
    dStopEventBar    := na
    dTargetEventBar  := na
    dMissedEventBar  := na
    dTerminalBar     := na
    dLastExitReason  := ""

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane E — Late-arrival / second-leg re-acceleration (PAPER hypothesis)
//
// This lane is deliberately realtime-only. It cannot replay a historical setup
// that occurred before this TradingView script/alert instance became live. After
// 10:30 it arms only in an established Fast-Mover context, waits for a NEW
// controlled pullback/base formed at or after eLiveStartBar, then requires a
// fresh break of that new bar's high. Existing D risk/extension/no-chase limits
// are reused to minimize new degrees of freedom.
// State: 0 scan, 1 strong mover / wait new PB-base, 2 ready, 3 in trade,
//        4 target/EOD exit, -1 stop, 5 missed/no chase.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
varip bool   eLiveEngineStarted = false
varip int    eLiveStartBar      = na
varip bool   eStartBarFullyObserved = false
varip int    eArmBar            = na
varip int    eReadyBar          = na
varip float  eEntry             = na
varip float  eStop              = na
varip float  eTarget            = na
varip float  eRisk              = na
varip float  eManagedStop       = na
varip float  eImpulseVolPeak    = na
varip float  ePauseVolRatio     = na
varip float  eInitialQty        = na
varip float  eRemainingQty      = na
varip bool   ePartialTaken      = false
varip int    ePartialEventBar   = na
varip int    eEntryEventBar     = na
varip int    eStopEventBar      = na
varip int    eTargetEventBar    = na
varip int    eMissedEventBar    = na
varip int    eTerminalBar       = na
varip string eLastExitReason    = ""
varip string eLastRejectReason  = "—"

// Lane-E shadow-stop research state. Independent from eState so measurement can
// continue after the REAL Stop-A trade has exited. No variable below is used by
// actionable entry/exit predicates.
varip bool   eStudyActive          = false
varip bool   eStudyDone            = false
varip int    eStudyEntryBar        = na
varip float  eStudyEntry           = na
varip float  eStudyStopA           = na
varip float  eStudyStopB           = na
varip float  eStudyRiskA           = na
varip float  eStudyRiskB           = na
varip float  eStudyTargetA         = na
varip float  eStudyTargetB         = na
varip float  eStudyShadowQtyB      = na
varip float  eStudyHighest         = na
varip float  eStudyLowest          = na
varip bool   eStudyAStopHit        = false
varip bool   eStudyA2RHit          = false
varip bool   eStudyBStopHit        = false
varip bool   eStudyB2RHit          = false
varip bool   eStudyAStopThen2R     = false
varip string eStudyFirstA          = "NONE"
varip string eStudyFirstB          = "NONE"
varip float  eStudyR15A            = na
varip float  eStudyR30A            = na
varip float  eStudyEodRA           = na
varip int    eStudyResultEventBar  = na
varip string eStudyLastSummary     = "—"

// EF0 Lane-E freshness / exhaustion research state. Measurement only.
// No EF0 variable is consumed by any live qualification or management predicate.
varip bool   ef0StudyActive             = false
varip bool   ef0StudyDone               = false
varip int    ef0StudyEntryBar           = na
varip int    ef0StudyEntryTime          = na
varip float  ef0StudyEntry              = na
varip float  ef0StudyStop               = na
varip float  ef0StudyRiskAtr            = na
varip float  ef0StudyExtAtr             = na
varip float  ef0StudyDayPct             = na
varip float  ef0StudyDayRs              = na
varip float  ef0StudyIntraRs            = na
varip float  ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3      = na
varip float  ef0StudyMemoryVolPeak      = na
varip float  ef0StudyPauseVol           = na
varip float  ef0StudyReAccelVol         = na
varip float  ef0StudyReAccelVsPause     = na
varip float  ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak      = na
varip bool   ef0StudyVolRenewed          = false
varip int    ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge   = na
varip float  ef0StudyPriorSessionHigh   = na
varip int    ef0StudyPriorHighAge       = na
varip float  ef0StudyVsPriorHighPct     = na
varip bool   ef0StudyReclaimedPriorHigh = false
varip float  ef0StudyT1                 = na
varip float  ef0StudyT2                 = na
varip float  ef0StudyT3                 = na
varip float  ef0StudyHighest            = na
varip float  ef0StudyLowest             = na
varip bool   ef0StudyStopHit            = false
varip bool   ef0StudyT1Hit              = false
varip bool   ef0StudyT2Hit              = false
varip bool   ef0StudyT3Hit              = false
varip int    ef0StudyStopTime           = na
varip int    ef0StudyT1Time             = na
varip int    ef0StudyT2Time             = na
varip int    ef0StudyT3Time             = na
varip string ef0StudyFirstEvent         = "NONE"
varip float  ef0StudyR5Pct              = na
varip float  ef0StudyR15Pct             = na
varip float  ef0StudyR30Pct             = na
varip string ef0StudyEndReason          = "—"
varip string ef0StudyLastSummary        = "—"
varip int    ef0StudyResultEventBar     = na

bool eResetToScan = false

if not symbolBuySlotOpen and eState != 3 and (eState == 1 or eState == 2)
    eResetToScan := true

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    eState             := 0
    eLiveEngineStarted := false
    eLiveStartBar      := na
    eStartBarFullyObserved := false
    eArmBar            := na
    eReadyBar          := na
    eEntry             := na
    eStop              := na
    eTarget            := na
    eRisk              := na
    eManagedStop       := na
    eImpulseVolPeak    := na
    ePauseVolRatio     := na
    eInitialQty        := na
    eRemainingQty      := na
    ePartialTaken      := false
    ePartialEventBar   := na
    eEntryEventBar     := na
    eStopEventBar      := na
    eTargetEventBar    := na
    eMissedEventBar    := na
    eTerminalBar       := na
    eLastExitReason    := ""
    eLastRejectReason  := "—"
    eStudyActive         := false
    eStudyDone           := false
    eStudyEntryBar       := na
    eStudyEntry          := na
    eStudyStopA          := na
    eStudyStopB          := na
    eStudyRiskA          := na
    eStudyRiskB          := na
    eStudyTargetA        := na
    eStudyTargetB        := na
    eStudyShadowQtyB     := na
    eStudyHighest        := na
    eStudyLowest         := na
    eStudyAStopHit       := false
    eStudyA2RHit         := false
    eStudyBStopHit       := false
    eStudyB2RHit         := false
    eStudyAStopThen2R    := false
    eStudyFirstA         := "NONE"
    eStudyFirstB         := "NONE"
    eStudyR15A           := na
    eStudyR30A           := na
    eStudyEodRA          := na
    eStudyResultEventBar := na
    eStudyLastSummary    := "—"
    ef0StudyActive             := false
    ef0StudyDone               := false
    ef0StudyEntryBar           := na
    ef0StudyEntryTime          := na
    ef0StudyEntry              := na
    ef0StudyStop               := na
    ef0StudyRiskAtr            := na
    ef0StudyExtAtr             := na
    ef0StudyDayPct             := na
    ef0StudyDayRs              := na
    ef0StudyIntraRs            := na
    ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3      := na
    ef0StudyMemoryVolPeak      := na
    ef0StudyPauseVol           := na
    ef0StudyReAccelVol         := na
    ef0StudyReAccelVsPause     := na
    ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak      := na
    ef0StudyVolRenewed          := false
    ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge   := na
    ef0StudyPriorSessionHigh   := na
    ef0StudyPriorHighAge       := na
    ef0StudyVsPriorHighPct     := na
    ef0StudyReclaimedPriorHigh := false
    ef0StudyT1                 := na
    ef0StudyT2                 := na
    ef0StudyT3                 := na
    ef0StudyHighest            := na
    ef0StudyLowest             := na
    ef0StudyStopHit            := false
    ef0StudyT1Hit              := false
    ef0StudyT2Hit              := false
    ef0StudyT3Hit              := false
    ef0StudyStopTime           := na
    ef0StudyT1Time             := na
    ef0StudyT2Time             := na
    ef0StudyT3Time             := na
    ef0StudyFirstEvent         := "NONE"
    ef0StudyR5Pct              := na
    ef0StudyR15Pct             := na
    ef0StudyR30Pct             := na
    ef0StudyEndReason          := "—"
    ef0StudyLastSummary        := "—"
    ef0StudyResultEventBar     := na

// First realtime update is the causal boundary for this lane. Historical bars
// before this point may provide known context/levels, but may never become an
// actionable Lane-E setup or BUY.
if barstate.isrealtime and not eLiveEngineStarted
    eLiveEngineStarted := true
    eLiveStartBar := bar_index
    eStartBarFullyObserved := barstate.isnew

if (eState == 4 or eState == -1) and not na(eTerminalBar) and bar_index - eTerminalBar >= terminalCooldownBars
    eResetToScan := true
if eState == 5 and not na(eTerminalBar) and bar_index - eTerminalBar >= missedCooldownBars
    eResetToScan := true
if not eWindowOpen and (eState == 1 or eState == 2)
    eResetToScan := true

// Strong-mover context keeps the existing Fast-Mover price/RS/liquidity gates,
// but VOLUME is session-memory based for Lane E. A late arrival should not be
// rejected simply because the original 3x/5x participation burst happened 20-40
// minutes earlier and the current healthy pullback is only ~1x volume.
eContextStrong = enableLaneE and eWindowOpen and barstate.isrealtime and isFiveMinute and
     emaTrendUp and aboveVWAP and liquidityOk and
     not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS and
     sessionVolImpulseOk

if eState == 0 and symbolBuySlotOpen and eContextStrong and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3
    eState            := 1
    eArmBar           := bar_index
    eReadyBar         := na
    eEntry            := na
    eStop             := na
    eTarget           := na
    eRisk             := na
    eManagedStop      := na
    eImpulseVolPeak   := sessionVolStrength
    ePauseVolRatio    := na
    eInitialQty       := na
    eRemainingQty     := na
    ePartialTaken     := false
    ePartialEventBar  := na
    eEntryEventBar    := na
    eStopEventBar     := na
    eTargetEventBar   := na
    eMissedEventBar   := na
    eLastExitReason   := ""
    eLastRejectReason := "WAIT NEW PB/BASE"

// Preserve the strongest volume evidence seen while this late-arrival episode is
// active. This is memory, not a requirement that every later bar remain abnormal.
if (eState == 1 or eState == 2) and not na(sessionVolStrength)
    eImpulseVolPeak := na(eImpulseVolPeak) ? sessionVolStrength : math.max(eImpulseVolPeak, sessionVolStrength)

// Candidate must be a NEW completed pause/pullback bar after the live boundary.
// We deliberately require it to sit below the previously-known 8-bar high, stay
// above EMA/VWAP, carry quieter volume than the REMEMBERED session impulse, and
// define a stop small enough for the existing D risk ceiling. No old trigger is
// replayed. We intentionally do NOT require the pullback itself to be >=2x.
ePriorHigh = priorHigh
ePauseContext = close > ema20 and close > vwap and liquidityOk and
     not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct > 0
ePauseBelowHigh = not na(ePriorHigh) and low < ePriorHigh and close <= ePriorHigh
ePauseRangeOk = not na(atr) and atr > 0 and barRange <= atr * D_MAX_RISK_ATR
ePauseVolumeOk = not na(eImpulseVolPeak) and eImpulseVolPeak >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE and
     not na(completedBarVolRatio) and completedBarVolRatio < eImpulseVolPeak
ePauseCandidate = eState == 1 and barstate.isrealtime and barstate.isconfirmed and
     not na(eLiveStartBar) and (bar_index > eLiveStartBar or (bar_index == eLiveStartBar and eStartBarFullyObserved)) and
     not na(eArmBar) and bar_index >= eArmBar and eWindowOpen and
     ePauseContext and ePauseBelowHigh and ePauseRangeOk and ePauseVolumeOk

if eState == 1 and barstate.isrealtime and barstate.isconfirmed
    eHardInvalid = close < ema20 or close < vwap or not liquidityOk or
         (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)
    if eHardInvalid
        eLastRejectReason := "LATE CONTEXT LOST"
        eResetToScan := true
    else if ePauseCandidate
        eEntryCandidate = high + syminfo.mintick
        eStopCandidate  = low - math.max(syminfo.mintick, atr * D_STOP_BUFFER_ATR)
        eRiskCandidate  = eEntryCandidate - eStopCandidate
        eQtyCandidate   = calcQty(eEntryCandidate, eStopCandidate)
        eEntryExtensionAtr = not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? (eEntryCandidate - ema20) / atr : na
        eRiskOk      = eRiskCandidate > 0 and eRiskCandidate <= atr * D_MAX_RISK_ATR
        eExtensionOk = not na(eEntryExtensionAtr) and eEntryExtensionAtr <= D_MAX_EXTENSION_ATR
        if eRiskOk and eExtensionOk and eQtyCandidate >= 1
            eReadyBar         := bar_index
            ePauseVolRatio    := completedBarVolRatio
            eEntry            := eEntryCandidate
            eStop             := eStopCandidate
            eRisk             := eRiskCandidate
            eTarget           := eEntry + eRisk * rrMultiple
            eState            := 2
            eReadyToday      += 1
            eLastRejectReason := "READY / RE-ACCEL"
            if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableSetupReadyAlerts
                alert("NG SETUP READY | Lane E RE-ACCEL | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Trigger " + str.tostring(eEntry, format.mintick) +
                      " | SL " + str.tostring(eStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | SessionVolPeak " + (na(eImpulseVolPeak) ? "—" : str.tostring(eImpulseVolPeak, "#.##") + "x") +
                      " | PBVol " + (na(ePauseVolRatio) ? "—" : str.tostring(ePauseVolRatio, "#.##") + "x") +
                      " | WAIT FOR NEW CONTINUATION — NOT YET A BUY",
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            eLastRejectReason := eQtyCandidate < 1 ? "QTY 0 / risk too large" :
                 not eRiskOk ? "PB/base risk > 1.10 ATR" :
                 "Entry too extended from EMA"
    else
        eLastRejectReason := not ePauseContext ? "WAIT STRONG CONTEXT" :
             not ePauseBelowHigh ? "WAIT NEW PB/BASE" :
             not ePauseRangeOk ? "PB/base too wide" :
             not ePauseVolumeOk ? "PB VOL NOT QUIETER THAN IMPULSE" :
             "WAIT NEW PB/BASE"

    // Do not stalk one stale late-arrival episode forever. Re-arm from current
    // context after the same first-pullback waiting horizon already used by A.
    if eState == 1 and not na(eArmBar) and bar_index - eArmBar >= MAX_BARS_TO_FIRST_PULLBACK
        eLastRejectReason := "NO NEW PB/BASE IN WINDOW"
        eResetToScan := true

// If another lane owns the position before E's trigger, E cannot also enter.
if eState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and (autoState == 3 or bState == 3 or cState == 3 or dState == 3) and high >= eEntry
    eLastRejectReason := "Trigger occurred while another lane owned trade"
    eResetToScan := true

if eState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and symbolBuySlotOpen and confirmedBullishActionBar and eWindowOpen and autoState != 3 and bState != 3 and cState != 3 and dState != 3 and not eResetToScan and close >= eEntry
    // Do NOT demand current/recent volume >=2x here. The stock already had to
    // prove abnormal participation earlier in this same session. We still record
    // whether volume pace is re-expanding versus the pullback, but it is a quality
    // diagnostic rather than a universal veto.
    eVolumeMemoryOk = not na(eImpulseVolPeak) and eImpulseVolPeak >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE
    eReAccelVolNow = maxNa(liveVolPaceUsable, completedBarVolRatio)
    eVolRenewed = not na(ePauseVolRatio) and not na(eReAccelVolNow) and eReAccelVolNow > ePauseVolRatio
    eBaseEntryContextOk = close > ema20 and close > vwap and liquidityOk and
         not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT and
         not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
         not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS and
         eVolumeMemoryOk
    ePlannedRisk  = eRisk
    eOvershootR   = ePlannedRisk > 0 ? (close - eEntry) / ePlannedRisk : 999.0
    eEntryFill    = close
    eEntryFillRisk = eEntryFill - eStop
    eEntryQty     = calcQty(eEntryFill, eStop)
    if eBaseEntryContextOk and eOvershootR <= D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R and eEntryFillRisk > 0 and eEntryQty >= 1
        eEntry           := eEntryFill
        eRisk            := eEntryFillRisk
        eTarget          := eEntry + eRisk * rrMultiple
        eState           := 3
        eManagedStop     := eStop
        eInitialQty      := eEntryQty
        eRemainingQty    := eEntryQty
        ePartialTaken    := false
        ePartialEventBar := na
        eEntryEventBar   := bar_index
        eBuyToday       += 1
        eLastExitReason  := ""

        // EF0 Lane-E freshness / exhaustion study. Measurement only.
        // It snapshots the ACTUAL Lane-E BUY without changing qualification,
        // sizing, stop placement, trade state or alerts.
        if enableEFreshStudy and not ef0StudyActive
            float ef0PriorHighNow = ef0SessionHigh[1]
            int   ef0PriorHighBarNow = ef0SessionHighBar[1]
            ef0StudyActive             := true
            ef0StudyDone               := false
            ef0StudyEntryBar           := bar_index
            ef0StudyEntryTime          := time_close
            ef0StudyEntry              := eEntry
            ef0StudyStop               := eStop
            ef0StudyRiskAtr            := not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? eRisk / atr : na
            ef0StudyExtAtr             := not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? (eEntry - ema20) / atr : na
            ef0StudyDayPct             := stockDayPct
            ef0StudyDayRs              := dayRsPct
            ef0StudyIntraRs            := rsSpreadPct
            ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3      := not na(rsSpreadPct[3]) ? rsSpreadPct - rsSpreadPct[3] : na
            ef0StudyMemoryVolPeak      := eImpulseVolPeak
            ef0StudyPauseVol           := ePauseVolRatio
            ef0StudyReAccelVol         := eReAccelVolNow
            ef0StudyReAccelVsPause     := not na(ePauseVolRatio) and ePauseVolRatio > 0 and not na(eReAccelVolNow) ? eReAccelVolNow / ePauseVolRatio : na
            ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak      := not na(eImpulseVolPeak) and eImpulseVolPeak > 0 and not na(eReAccelVolNow) ? eReAccelVolNow / eImpulseVolPeak : na
            ef0StudyVolRenewed          := eVolRenewed
            ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge   := not na(sessionMoverVolBar) ? bar_index - sessionMoverVolBar : na
            ef0StudyPriorSessionHigh   := ef0PriorHighNow
            ef0StudyPriorHighAge       := not na(ef0PriorHighBarNow) ? bar_index - ef0PriorHighBarNow : na
            ef0StudyVsPriorHighPct     := not na(ef0PriorHighNow) and ef0PriorHighNow > 0 ? (eEntry / ef0PriorHighNow - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
            ef0StudyReclaimedPriorHigh := not na(ef0PriorHighNow) and eEntry >= ef0PriorHighNow
            ef0StudyT1                 := eEntry * (1.0 + EF0_STUDY_T1_PCT / 100.0)
            ef0StudyT2                 := eEntry * (1.0 + EF0_STUDY_T2_PCT / 100.0)
            ef0StudyT3                 := eEntry * (1.0 + EF0_STUDY_T3_PCT / 100.0)
            ef0StudyHighest            := eEntry
            ef0StudyLowest             := eEntry
            ef0StudyStopHit            := false
            ef0StudyT1Hit              := false
            ef0StudyT2Hit              := false
            ef0StudyT3Hit              := false
            ef0StudyStopTime           := na
            ef0StudyT1Time             := na
            ef0StudyT2Time             := na
            ef0StudyT3Time             := na
            ef0StudyFirstEvent         := "NONE"
            ef0StudyR5Pct              := na
            ef0StudyR15Pct             := na
            ef0StudyR30Pct             := na
            ef0StudyEndReason          := "RUNNING"
            ef0StudyLastSummary        := "RUNNING"
            ef0StudyResultEventBar     := na

            if enablePineAlerts and enableEFreshResearchAlerts
                alert("NG RESEARCH EF0 ENTRY | Lane E | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Entry " + str.tostring(ef0StudyEntry, format.mintick) +
                      " | RiskATR " + (na(ef0StudyRiskAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyRiskAtr, "#.##")) +
                      " | ExtATR " + (na(ef0StudyExtAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyExtAtr, "#.##")) +
                      " | VolRenewed " + (ef0StudyVolRenewed ? "YES" : "NO") +
                      " | ReAccel/PB " + (na(ef0StudyReAccelVsPause) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyReAccelVsPause, "#.##") + "x") +
                      " | ReAccel/Peak " + (na(ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak, "#.##") + "x") +
                      " | PeakAgeBars " + (na(ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge)) +
                      " | RSd3 " + (na(ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3, "#.##") + "%") +
                      " | VsPriorHigh " + (na(ef0StudyVsPriorHighPct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyVsPriorHighPct, "#.##") + "%") +
                      " | ReclaimHigh " + (ef0StudyReclaimedPriorHigh ? "YES" : "NO") +
                      actionMeta("RESEARCH_EF0_ENTRY", time),
                      alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

        // Measurement-only A-vs-B stop study. It starts from this confirmed
        // Lane-E entry and never feeds back into live trade management.
        if enableEShadowStudy
            eStudyStructLow = ta.lowest(low[1], E_STUDY_SHADOW_LOOKBACK)
            eStudyShadowRaw = not na(eStudyStructLow) and not na(atr) and atr > 0 ?
                 eStudyStructLow - math.max(syminfo.mintick, atr * E_STUDY_SHADOW_BUFFER_ATR) : eStop
            eStudyActive         := true
            eStudyDone           := false
            eStudyEntryBar       := bar_index
            eStudyEntry          := eEntry
            eStudyStopA          := eStop
            eStudyStopB          := math.min(eStop, eStudyShadowRaw)
            eStudyRiskA          := eStudyEntry - eStudyStopA
            eStudyRiskB          := eStudyEntry - eStudyStopB
            eStudyTargetA        := eStudyEntry + eStudyRiskA * rrMultiple
            eStudyTargetB        := eStudyEntry + eStudyRiskB * rrMultiple
            eStudyShadowQtyB     := calcQty(eStudyEntry, eStudyStopB)
            eStudyHighest        := eStudyEntry
            eStudyLowest         := eStudyEntry
            eStudyAStopHit       := false
            eStudyA2RHit         := false
            eStudyBStopHit       := false
            eStudyB2RHit         := false
            eStudyAStopThen2R    := false
            eStudyFirstA         := "NONE"
            eStudyFirstB         := "NONE"
            eStudyR15A           := na
            eStudyR30A           := na
            eStudyEodRA          := na
            eStudyResultEventBar := na
            eStudyLastSummary    := "RUNNING"

        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER BUY NOW | Lane E RE-ACCEL | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Day " + str.tostring(stockDayPct, "#.##") + "%" +
                  " | DayRS " + str.tostring(dayRsPct, "#.##") + "%" +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(eEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | SL " + str.tostring(eStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | Qty " + str.tostring(eEntryQty, "#") +
                  " | Position ₹" + str.tostring(eEntryQty * eEntry, "#.##") +
                  " | MaxRisk ₹" + str.tostring(eEntryQty * eRisk, "#.##") +
                  " | PosCap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#.##") +
                  " | SessionVolPeak " + (na(eImpulseVolPeak) ? "—" : str.tostring(eImpulseVolPeak, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | PBVol " + (na(ePauseVolRatio) ? "—" : str.tostring(ePauseVolRatio, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | ReAccelVol " + (na(eReAccelVolNow) ? "—" : str.tostring(eReAccelVolNow, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | VolRenewed " + (eVolRenewed ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | FirstTake " + str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R @ " + str.tostring(eTarget, format.mintick) +
                  " | Then RUNNER" + actionMeta("BUY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        eState          := 5
        eMissedEventBar := bar_index
        eTerminalBar    := bar_index
        eRejectToday   += 1
        eLastRejectReason := eEntryQty < 1 ? "QTY 0 / RISK TOO LARGE" :
             not eBaseEntryContextOk ? "CONTEXT LOST" :
             eOvershootR > D_MAX_ENTRY_OVERSHOOT_R ? "NO CHASE" :
             "RE-ACCEL REJECTED"
        if enablePineAlerts and not actionAlertsOnly and enableMissedAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER MISSED | Lane E RE-ACCEL | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | " + eLastRejectReason +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | Trigger " + str.tostring(eEntry, format.mintick),
                  alert.freq_all)

if eState == 2 and barstate.isrealtime and close <= eStop
    eLastRejectReason := "READY setup invalidated"
    eResetToScan := true

if eState == 2 and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > eReadyBar
    eReadyInvalid = close < ema20 or close < vwap or low <= eStop or not liquidityOk or
         (not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct <= 0)
    if eReadyInvalid
        eLastRejectReason := "READY setup invalidated"
        eResetToScan := true
    else if bar_index - eReadyBar >= D_MAX_READY_BARS
        eLastRejectReason := "READY setup expired"
        eResetToScan := true

if eState == 3 and barstate.isrealtime
    if na(eManagedStop)
        eManagedStop := eStop
    if ePartialTaken and enableRunnerTrail and bar_index > ePartialEventBar
        eManagedStop := calcRunnerStop(eEntry, eManagedStop, runnerRecentLow, atr)

    qtyEExit      = not na(eRemainingQty) ? eRemainingQty : calcQty(eEntry, eStop)
    rNowE         = eRisk > 0 ? (close - eEntry) / eRisk : na
    eStopNow      = close <= eManagedStop
    eFirstTakeNow = not ePartialTaken and close >= eTarget

    if eStopNow
        eState        := -1
        eStopEventBar := bar_index
        eTerminalBar  := bar_index
        stopKindE = eManagedStop > eStop + syminfo.mintick ? "RUNNER / PROTECTIVE STOP" : "STOP"
        eLastExitReason := stopKindE
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / " + stopKindE + " | Lane E RE-ACCEL | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | ManagedSL " + str.tostring(eManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyEExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowE, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_STOP", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if forceExitNow
        eState          := 4
        eTargetEventBar := bar_index
        eTerminalBar    := bar_index
        eLastExitReason := "EOD EXIT"
        if enablePineAlerts
            alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / EOD SAFETY EXIT | Lane E RE-ACCEL | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                  " | SellQty " + str.tostring(qtyEExit, "#") +
                  " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowE, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_EOD", time),
                  alert.freq_all)
    else if eFirstTakeNow
        eTakeQty = calcPartialQty(eInitialQty)
        if eTakeQty >= eRemainingQty
            eState          := 4
            eTargetEventBar := bar_index
            eTerminalBar    := bar_index
            eLastExitReason := "FIRST TAKE / FULL"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / FIRST TAKE FULL | Lane E | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(eRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowE, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_FIRST_TAKE_FULL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)
        else
            eRemainingQty := eRemainingQty - eTakeQty
            ePartialTaken := true
            ePartialEventBar := bar_index
            eManagedStop := math.max(eManagedStop, eEntry)
            eLastExitReason := "PARTIAL / RUNNER"
            if enablePineAlerts
                alert("NG PAPER SELL NOW / TAKE " + str.tostring(partialExitPct, "#") + "% | Lane E | " + syminfo.ticker +
                      " | Last " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) +
                      " | SellQty " + str.tostring(eTakeQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerQty " + str.tostring(eRemainingQty, "#") +
                      " | RunnerSL>= " + str.tostring(eManagedStop, format.mintick) +
                      " | ApproxR " + str.tostring(rNowE, "#.##") + actionMeta("SELL_PARTIAL", time),
                      alert.freq_all)

if eResetToScan
    eState            := 0
    eArmBar           := na
    eReadyBar         := na
    eEntry            := na
    eStop             := na
    eTarget           := na
    eRisk             := na
    eManagedStop      := na
    eImpulseVolPeak   := na
    ePauseVolRatio    := na
    eInitialQty       := na
    eRemainingQty     := na
    ePartialTaken     := false
    ePartialEventBar  := na
    eEntryEventBar    := na
    eStopEventBar     := na
    eTargetEventBar   := na
    eMissedEventBar   := na
    eTerminalBar      := na
    eLastExitReason   := ""

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Lane-E shadow-stop study tracker — MEASUREMENT ONLY
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
if enableEShadowStudy and eStudyActive and barstate.isrealtime and not eStudyDone
    bool eStudyPostEntry = not na(eStudyEntryBar) and bar_index > eStudyEntryBar

    if eStudyPostEntry
        eStudyHighest := na(eStudyHighest) ? high : math.max(eStudyHighest, high)
        eStudyLowest  := na(eStudyLowest)  ? low  : math.min(eStudyLowest, low)

        if not eStudyAStopHit and not na(eStudyStopA) and close <= eStudyStopA
            eStudyAStopHit := true
            if eStudyFirstA == "NONE"
                eStudyFirstA := "STOP"

        if not eStudyA2RHit and not na(eStudyTargetA) and close >= eStudyTargetA
            eStudyA2RHit := true
            if eStudyAStopHit
                eStudyAStopThen2R := true
            if eStudyFirstA == "NONE"
                eStudyFirstA := "2R"

        if not eStudyBStopHit and not na(eStudyStopB) and close <= eStudyStopB
            eStudyBStopHit := true
            if eStudyFirstB == "NONE"
                eStudyFirstB := "STOP"

        if not eStudyB2RHit and not na(eStudyTargetB) and close >= eStudyTargetB
            eStudyB2RHit := true
            if eStudyFirstB == "NONE"
                eStudyFirstB := "2R"

    if barstate.isconfirmed and eStudyPostEntry
        int eStudyBarsSinceEntry = bar_index - eStudyEntryBar
        if na(eStudyR15A) and eStudyBarsSinceEntry >= 3 and eStudyRiskA > 0
            eStudyR15A := (close - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskA
        if na(eStudyR30A) and eStudyBarsSinceEntry >= 6 and eStudyRiskA > 0
            eStudyR30A := (close - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskA

    if forceExitNow and eStudyResultEventBar != bar_index
        eStudyEodRA := eStudyRiskA > 0 ? (close - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskA : na
        eStudyMfeA = eStudyRiskA > 0 and not na(eStudyHighest) ? (eStudyHighest - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskA : na
        eStudyMaeA = eStudyRiskA > 0 and not na(eStudyLowest) ? (eStudyLowest - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskA : na
        eStudyMfeB = eStudyRiskB > 0 and not na(eStudyHighest) ? (eStudyHighest - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskB : na
        eStudyMaeB = eStudyRiskB > 0 and not na(eStudyLowest) ? (eStudyLowest - eStudyEntry) / eStudyRiskB : na
        eStudyLastSummary := "A " + eStudyFirstA + " | B " + eStudyFirstB + (eStudyAStopThen2R ? " | A→2R" : "")
        eStudyResultEventBar := bar_index
        eStudyDone   := true
        eStudyActive := false

        if enablePineAlerts and enableResearchResultAlerts
            alert("NG RESEARCH RESULT | Lane E SHADOW STOP | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(eStudyEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | StopA " + str.tostring(eStudyStopA, format.mintick) +
                  " | StopB " + str.tostring(eStudyStopB, format.mintick) +
                  " | QtyB " + (na(eStudyShadowQtyB) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyShadowQtyB, "#")) +
                  " | FirstA " + eStudyFirstA +
                  " | FirstB " + eStudyFirstB +
                  " | AStop " + (eStudyAStopHit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | A2R " + (eStudyA2RHit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | AStopThen2R " + (eStudyAStopThen2R ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | BStop " + (eStudyBStopHit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | B2R " + (eStudyB2RHit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | MFE_A " + (na(eStudyMfeA) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyMfeA, "#.##") + "R") +
                  " | MAE_A " + (na(eStudyMaeA) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyMaeA, "#.##") + "R") +
                  " | MFE_B " + (na(eStudyMfeB) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyMfeB, "#.##") + "R") +
                  " | MAE_B " + (na(eStudyMaeB) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyMaeB, "#.##") + "R") +
                  " | R15_A " + (na(eStudyR15A) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyR15A, "#.##")) +
                  " | R30_A " + (na(eStudyR30A) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyR30A, "#.##")) +
                  " | EOD_A " + (na(eStudyEodRA) ? "—" : str.tostring(eStudyEodRA, "#.##")),
                  alert.freq_all)

// Data-Window-only study levels. They do not occupy chart space.
plot(enableEShadowStudy and (eStudyActive or eStudyDone) ? eStudyStopA : na, title="E Study Stop A", color=color.new(color.red, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEShadowStudy and (eStudyActive or eStudyDone) ? eStudyStopB : na, title="E Study Stop B", color=color.new(color.red, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEShadowStudy and (eStudyActive or eStudyDone) ? eStudyTargetA : na, title="E Study 2R A", color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEShadowStudy and (eStudyActive or eStudyDone) ? eStudyTargetB : na, title="E Study 2R B", color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// EF0 Lane-E freshness / exhaustion tracker — MEASUREMENT ONLY
// Tracks the post-entry path independently from real eState so an actual stop can
// still be classified as stop-then-recovery versus persistent deterioration.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
if enableEFreshStudy and ef0StudyActive and barstate.isrealtime and not ef0StudyDone
    bool ef0PostEntry = not na(ef0StudyEntryBar) and bar_index > ef0StudyEntryBar

    if ef0PostEntry
        ef0StudyHighest := na(ef0StudyHighest) ? high : math.max(ef0StudyHighest, high)
        ef0StudyLowest  := na(ef0StudyLowest)  ? low  : math.min(ef0StudyLowest, low)

        bool ef0StopNow = not ef0StudyStopHit and not na(ef0StudyStop) and close <= ef0StudyStop
        bool ef0T1Now   = not ef0StudyT1Hit and not na(ef0StudyT1) and close >= ef0StudyT1
        bool ef0T2Now   = not ef0StudyT2Hit and not na(ef0StudyT2) and close >= ef0StudyT2
        bool ef0T3Now   = not ef0StudyT3Hit and not na(ef0StudyT3) and close >= ef0StudyT3

        if ef0StopNow
            ef0StudyStopHit  := true
            ef0StudyStopTime := timenow
            if ef0StudyFirstEvent == "NONE"
                ef0StudyFirstEvent := "STOP"

        if ef0T1Now
            ef0StudyT1Hit  := true
            ef0StudyT1Time := timenow
            if ef0StudyFirstEvent == "NONE"
                ef0StudyFirstEvent := "T1"

        if ef0T2Now
            ef0StudyT2Hit  := true
            ef0StudyT2Time := timenow

        if ef0T3Now
            ef0StudyT3Hit  := true
            ef0StudyT3Time := timenow

    if barstate.isconfirmed and ef0PostEntry
        int ef0BarsSinceEntry = bar_index - ef0StudyEntryBar
        if na(ef0StudyR5Pct) and ef0BarsSinceEntry >= 1
            ef0StudyR5Pct := (close / ef0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0
        if na(ef0StudyR15Pct) and ef0BarsSinceEntry >= 3
            ef0StudyR15Pct := (close / ef0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0
        if na(ef0StudyR30Pct) and ef0BarsSinceEntry >= EF0_STUDY_HORIZON_BARS
            ef0StudyR30Pct := (close / ef0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0

    bool ef0HorizonDone = barstate.isconfirmed and ef0PostEntry and
         bar_index - ef0StudyEntryBar >= EF0_STUDY_HORIZON_BARS
    bool ef0ForceDone = forceExitNow

    if (ef0HorizonDone or ef0ForceDone) and ef0StudyResultEventBar != bar_index
        float ef0MfePct = not na(ef0StudyHighest) and ef0StudyEntry > 0 ? (ef0StudyHighest / ef0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float ef0MaePct = not na(ef0StudyLowest) and ef0StudyEntry > 0 ? (ef0StudyLowest / ef0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        bool ef0StopThenT1 = ef0StudyFirstEvent == "STOP" and ef0StudyT1Hit
        ef0StudyEndReason := ef0ForceDone ? "EOD" : "30M"
        ef0StudyLastSummary := "First " + ef0StudyFirstEvent +
             " | T1 " + (ef0StudyT1Hit ? "Y" : "N") +
             " | T2 " + (ef0StudyT2Hit ? "Y" : "N") +
             " | T3 " + (ef0StudyT3Hit ? "Y" : "N") +
             (ef0StopThenT1 ? " | STOP→T1" : "")
        ef0StudyResultEventBar := bar_index
        ef0StudyDone   := true
        ef0StudyActive := false

        if enablePineAlerts and enableEFreshResearchAlerts
            alert("NG RESEARCH EF0 RESULT | Lane E | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | First " + ef0StudyFirstEvent +
                  " | Stop " + (ef0StudyStopHit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T1 " + (ef0StudyT1Hit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T2 " + (ef0StudyT2Hit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | T3 " + (ef0StudyT3Hit ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | StopThenT1 " + (ef0StopThenT1 ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | MFE " + (na(ef0MfePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0MfePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | MAE " + (na(ef0MaePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0MaePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | R5 " + (na(ef0StudyR5Pct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyR5Pct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | R15 " + (na(ef0StudyR15Pct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyR15Pct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | R30 " + (na(ef0StudyR30Pct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyR30Pct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | VolRenewed " + (ef0StudyVolRenewed ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | ReAccel/PB " + (na(ef0StudyReAccelVsPause) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyReAccelVsPause, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | ReAccel/Peak " + (na(ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyReAccelVsPeak, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | PeakAgeBars " + (na(ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyConfirmedPeakAge)) +
                  " | RiskATR " + (na(ef0StudyRiskAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyRiskAtr, "#.##")) +
                  " | ExtATR " + (na(ef0StudyExtAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyExtAtr, "#.##")) +
                  " | RSd3 " + (na(ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3) ? "—" : str.tostring(ef0StudyIntraRsDelta3, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | ReclaimHigh " + (ef0StudyReclaimedPriorHigh ? "YES" : "NO") +
                  " | End " + ef0StudyEndReason +
                  actionMeta("RESEARCH_EF0_RESULT", time),
                  alert.freq_all)

// Data-Window-only EF0 diagnostics. Never used by live logic.
plot(enableEFreshStudy and (ef0StudyActive or ef0StudyDone) ? ef0StudyRiskAtr : na,
     title="EF0 Risk ATR", color=color.new(color.gray, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEFreshStudy and (ef0StudyActive or ef0StudyDone) ? ef0StudyExtAtr : na,
     title="EF0 Extension ATR", color=color.new(color.gray, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEFreshStudy and (ef0StudyActive or ef0StudyDone) ? (ef0StudyVolRenewed ? 1.0 : 0.0) : na,
     title="EF0 Vol Renewed", color=color.new(color.gray, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEFreshStudy and (ef0StudyActive or ef0StudyDone) ? ef0StudyReAccelVsPause : na,
     title="EF0 ReAccel/PB Vol", color=color.new(color.gray, 100), display=display.data_window)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Per-lane risk sizing
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
aLevelsValid = not na(autoEntry) and not na(autoStop) and autoEntry > autoStop
aRiskPerShare = aLevelsValid ? autoEntry - autoStop : na
aRiskQty       = aLevelsValid and aRiskPerShare > 0 ? math.floor(riskBudget / aRiskPerShare) : na
aCapitalQty    = aLevelsValid and autoEntry > 0 ? math.floor(maxPositionValue / autoEntry) : na
aPaperQty      = not na(aRiskQty) and not na(aCapitalQty) ? math.min(aRiskQty, aCapitalQty) : na
aEffectiveRisk = aLevelsValid and not na(aPaperQty) ? aPaperQty * aRiskPerShare : na

bLevelsValid = not na(bEntry) and not na(bStop) and bEntry > bStop
bRiskPerShare = bLevelsValid ? bEntry - bStop : na
bRiskQty       = bLevelsValid and bRiskPerShare > 0 ? math.floor(riskBudget / bRiskPerShare) : na
bCapitalQty    = bLevelsValid and bEntry > 0 ? math.floor(maxPositionValue / bEntry) : na
bPaperQty      = not na(bRiskQty) and not na(bCapitalQty) ? math.min(bRiskQty, bCapitalQty) : na
bEffectiveRisk = bLevelsValid and not na(bPaperQty) ? bPaperQty * bRiskPerShare : na

cLevelsValid = not na(cEntry) and not na(cStop) and cEntry > cStop
cRiskPerShare = cLevelsValid ? cEntry - cStop : na
cRiskQty       = cLevelsValid and cRiskPerShare > 0 ? math.floor(riskBudget / cRiskPerShare) : na
cCapitalQty    = cLevelsValid and cEntry > 0 ? math.floor(maxPositionValue / cEntry) : na
cPaperQty      = not na(cRiskQty) and not na(cCapitalQty) ? math.min(cRiskQty, cCapitalQty) : na
cEffectiveRisk = cLevelsValid and not na(cPaperQty) ? cPaperQty * cRiskPerShare : na

dLevelsValid = not na(dEntry) and not na(dStop) and dEntry > dStop
dRiskPerShare = dLevelsValid ? dEntry - dStop : na
dRiskQty       = dLevelsValid and dRiskPerShare > 0 ? math.floor(riskBudget / dRiskPerShare) : na
dCapitalQty    = dLevelsValid and dEntry > 0 ? math.floor(maxPositionValue / dEntry) : na
dPaperQty      = not na(dRiskQty) and not na(dCapitalQty) ? math.min(dRiskQty, dCapitalQty) : na
dEffectiveRisk = dLevelsValid and not na(dPaperQty) ? dPaperQty * dRiskPerShare : na
eLevelsValid = not na(eEntry) and not na(eStop) and eEntry > eStop
eRiskPerShare = eLevelsValid ? eEntry - eStop : na
ePaperQty = eLevelsValid ? calcQty(eEntry, eStop) : 0.0
eEffectiveRisk = eLevelsValid and ePaperQty >= 1 ? ePaperQty * eRiskPerShare : na

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Clean context plots
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sameHighLevel = not na(pdh) and not na(pwh) and math.abs(pdh - pwh) <= syminfo.mintick
sameLowLevel  = not na(pdl) and not na(pwl) and math.abs(pdl - pwl) <= syminfo.mintick

plot(showPD ? pdh : na, "PDH", color=color.new(color.red, 30), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane)
plot(showPD ? pdl : na, "PDL", color=color.new(color.green, 30), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane)
plot(showPW and not sameHighLevel ? pwh : na, "PWH", color=color.new(color.red, 60), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane)
plot(showPW and not sameLowLevel ? pwl : na, "PWL", color=color.new(color.green, 60), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane)
plot(showVWAP ? vwap : na, "Session VWAP", color=color.new(color.blue, 0), linewidth=2, display=display.pane)
plot(showEMA ? ema20 : na, "EMA", color=color.new(color.orange, 0), linewidth=2, display=display.pane)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Combined event/focus logic. Lanes remain independently defined for research,
// but only the most actionable current lane gets chart geometry to avoid clutter.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
aEntryNow  = not na(entryEventBar) and bar_index == entryEventBar
aStopNow   = not na(stopEventBar) and bar_index == stopEventBar
aTargetNow = not na(targetEventBar) and bar_index == targetEventBar
aPartialNow = not na(autoPartialEventBar) and bar_index == autoPartialEventBar
bEntryNow  = not na(bEntryEventBar) and bar_index == bEntryEventBar
bStopNowEv = not na(bStopEventBar) and bar_index == bStopEventBar
bTargetNowEv = not na(bTargetEventBar) and bar_index == bTargetEventBar
bPartialNow = not na(bPartialEventBar) and bar_index == bPartialEventBar
cEntryNow  = not na(cEntryEventBar) and bar_index == cEntryEventBar
cStopNowEv = not na(cStopEventBar) and bar_index == cStopEventBar
cTargetNowEv = not na(cTargetEventBar) and bar_index == cTargetEventBar
cPartialNow = not na(cPartialEventBar) and bar_index == cPartialEventBar
dEntryNow  = not na(dEntryEventBar) and bar_index == dEntryEventBar
dStopNowEv = not na(dStopEventBar) and bar_index == dStopEventBar
dTargetNowEv = not na(dTargetEventBar) and bar_index == dTargetEventBar
dPartialNow = not na(dPartialEventBar) and bar_index == dPartialEventBar
eEntryNow  = not na(eEntryEventBar) and bar_index == eEntryEventBar
eStopNowEv = not na(eStopEventBar) and bar_index == eStopEventBar
eTargetNowEv = not na(eTargetEventBar) and bar_index == eTargetEventBar
ePartialNow = not na(ePartialEventBar) and bar_index == ePartialEventBar

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// EC0 — Early Confirmed Candidate coverage study — MEASUREMENT ONLY.
//
// Research question:
// After Python has already surfaced a candidate, is Pine waiting so long for the
// +4% Fast-Mover gate / pullback / rebreak / second confirmation that a simple
// confirmed bullish 5m continuation already had +1%/+2%/+3% available?
//
// To avoid inventing a new tuned selector, EC0 starts from the CURRENT Fast-Mover
// core with exactly ONE qualification removed: FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT. All other
// Fast-Mover context requirements are reused byte-for-byte. The shadow then uses
// the existing confirmedBullishActionBar and entryWindowOpen safety conditions.
//
// EC0 is forward-only and cannot change any A/B/C/D/E state, BUY counter, live
// stop/target/quantity, dashboard ACTION, or actionable alert() qualification.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bool ec0CoreNoDayMove = isFiveMinute and emaTrendUp and fastVwapOk and liquidityOk and
     not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT and
     not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS and
     not na(fastVolStrength) and fastVolStrength >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE

varip bool   ec0StudyStartedToday   = false
varip bool   ec0StudyActive         = false
varip bool   ec0StudyDone           = false
varip int    ec0StudyEntryBar       = na
varip int    ec0StudyEntryTime      = na
varip float  ec0StudyEntry          = na
varip float  ec0StudyRefStop        = na
varip float  ec0StudyStructStop     = na
varip float  ec0StudyStructRisk     = na
varip float  ec0StudyStructRiskAtr  = na
varip float  ec0StudyQtyRef         = na
varip float  ec0StudyQtyStruct      = na
varip float  ec0StudyT1             = na
varip float  ec0StudyT2             = na
varip float  ec0StudyT3             = na
varip float  ec0StudyHighest        = na
varip float  ec0StudyLowest         = na
varip bool   ec0StudyT1Hit          = false
varip bool   ec0StudyT2Hit          = false
varip bool   ec0StudyT3Hit          = false
varip bool   ec0StudyRefStopHit     = false
varip bool   ec0StudyStructStopHit  = false
varip int    ec0StudyT1Time         = na
varip int    ec0StudyT2Time         = na
varip int    ec0StudyT3Time         = na
varip int    ec0StudyRefStopTime    = na
varip int    ec0StudyStructStopTime = na
varip int    ec0StudyFastMoverTime  = na
varip int    ec0StudyLiveBuyTime    = na
varip string ec0StudyLiveBuyLane    = "NONE"
varip float  ec0StudyDayPctAtEntry  = na
varip float  ec0StudyDayRsAtEntry   = na
varip float  ec0StudyIntraRsAtEntry = na
varip float  ec0StudyVolAtEntry     = na
varip float  ec0StudyExtAtrAtEntry  = na
varip string ec0StudyCStateAtEntry  = "—"
varip string ec0StudyEndReason      = "—"
varip string ec0StudyLastSummary    = "—"
varip int    ec0StudyResultEventBar = na

if newDayReset or not isFiveMinute
    ec0StudyStartedToday   := false
    ec0StudyActive         := false
    ec0StudyDone           := false
    ec0StudyEntryBar       := na
    ec0StudyEntryTime      := na
    ec0StudyEntry          := na
    ec0StudyRefStop        := na
    ec0StudyStructStop     := na
    ec0StudyStructRisk     := na
    ec0StudyStructRiskAtr  := na
    ec0StudyQtyRef         := na
    ec0StudyQtyStruct      := na
    ec0StudyT1             := na
    ec0StudyT2             := na
    ec0StudyT3             := na
    ec0StudyHighest        := na
    ec0StudyLowest         := na
    ec0StudyT1Hit          := false
    ec0StudyT2Hit          := false
    ec0StudyT3Hit          := false
    ec0StudyRefStopHit     := false
    ec0StudyStructStopHit  := false
    ec0StudyT1Time         := na
    ec0StudyT2Time         := na
    ec0StudyT3Time         := na
    ec0StudyRefStopTime    := na
    ec0StudyStructStopTime := na
    ec0StudyFastMoverTime  := na
    ec0StudyLiveBuyTime    := na
    ec0StudyLiveBuyLane    := "NONE"
    ec0StudyDayPctAtEntry  := na
    ec0StudyDayRsAtEntry   := na
    ec0StudyIntraRsAtEntry := na
    ec0StudyVolAtEntry     := na
    ec0StudyExtAtrAtEntry  := na
    ec0StudyCStateAtEntry  := "—"
    ec0StudyEndReason      := "—"
    ec0StudyLastSummary    := "—"
    ec0StudyResultEventBar := na

bool ec0LaunchNow = enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and
     not ec0StudyStartedToday and not ec0StudyActive and not ec0StudyDone and
     barstate.isrealtime and confirmedBullishActionBar and entryWindowOpen and
     symbolBuysToday == 0 and ec0CoreNoDayMove

if ec0LaunchNow
    float ec0EntryCandidate      = close
    float ec0RefStopCandidate    = ec0EntryCandidate * (1.0 - EC0_STUDY_REF_STOP_PCT / 100.0)
    float ec0StructStopCandidate = low - math.max(syminfo.mintick, atr * D_STOP_BUFFER_ATR)
    float ec0StructRiskCandidate = ec0EntryCandidate - ec0StructStopCandidate
    float ec0QtyRefCandidate     = calcQty(ec0EntryCandidate, ec0RefStopCandidate)
    float ec0QtyStructCandidate  = calcQty(ec0EntryCandidate, ec0StructStopCandidate)

    if ec0EntryCandidate > 0 and ec0RefStopCandidate > 0 and ec0StructRiskCandidate > 0
        ec0StudyStartedToday   := true
        ec0StudyActive         := true
        ec0StudyDone           := false
        ec0StudyEntryBar       := bar_index
        ec0StudyEntryTime      := time_close
        ec0StudyEntry          := ec0EntryCandidate
        ec0StudyRefStop        := ec0RefStopCandidate
        ec0StudyStructStop     := ec0StructStopCandidate
        ec0StudyStructRisk     := ec0StructRiskCandidate
        ec0StudyStructRiskAtr  := not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? ec0StructRiskCandidate / atr : na
        ec0StudyQtyRef         := ec0QtyRefCandidate
        ec0StudyQtyStruct      := ec0QtyStructCandidate
        ec0StudyT1             := ec0StudyEntry * (1.0 + EC0_STUDY_T1_PCT / 100.0)
        ec0StudyT2             := ec0StudyEntry * (1.0 + EC0_STUDY_T2_PCT / 100.0)
        ec0StudyT3             := ec0StudyEntry * (1.0 + EC0_STUDY_T3_PCT / 100.0)
        ec0StudyHighest        := ec0StudyEntry
        ec0StudyLowest         := ec0StudyEntry
        ec0StudyT1Hit          := false
        ec0StudyT2Hit          := false
        ec0StudyT3Hit          := false
        ec0StudyRefStopHit     := false
        ec0StudyStructStopHit  := false
        ec0StudyT1Time         := na
        ec0StudyT2Time         := na
        ec0StudyT3Time         := na
        ec0StudyRefStopTime    := na
        ec0StudyStructStopTime := na
        ec0StudyFastMoverTime  := fastMoverCore ? time_close : na
        ec0StudyLiveBuyTime    := na
        ec0StudyLiveBuyLane    := "NONE"
        ec0StudyDayPctAtEntry  := stockDayPct
        ec0StudyDayRsAtEntry   := dayRsPct
        ec0StudyIntraRsAtEntry := rsSpreadPct
        ec0StudyVolAtEntry     := fastVolStrength
        ec0StudyExtAtrAtEntry  := not na(atr) and atr > 0 ? (close - ema20) / atr : na
        ec0StudyCStateAtEntry  := cState == 2 ? "C READY" :
             cState == 3 ? "C TRADE" :
             not na(cLastRejectBar) and bar_index - cLastRejectBar <= 1 ? cLastRejectReason :
             "NO C ARM"
        ec0StudyEndReason      := "RUNNING"
        ec0StudyLastSummary    := "RUNNING"
        ec0StudyResultEventBar := na

        if enablePineAlerts and enableEarlyConfirmedResearchAlerts
            alert("NG RESEARCH EC0 ENTRY | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(ec0StudyEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | Day " + (na(ec0StudyDayPctAtEntry) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyDayPctAtEntry, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | DayRS " + (na(ec0StudyDayRsAtEntry) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyDayRsAtEntry, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | IntraRS " + (na(ec0StudyIntraRsAtEntry) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyIntraRsAtEntry, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | Vol " + (na(ec0StudyVolAtEntry) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyVolAtEntry, "#.##") + "x") +
                  " | ExtATR " + (na(ec0StudyExtAtrAtEntry) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyExtAtrAtEntry, "#.##")) +
                  " | StructRiskATR " + (na(ec0StudyStructRiskAtr) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0StudyStructRiskAtr, "#.##")) +
                  " | C " + ec0StudyCStateAtEntry +
                  actionMeta("RESEARCH_EC0_ENTRY", time),
                  alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

// Track the forward path independently from all live lane state.
if enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and ec0StudyActive and barstate.isrealtime
    bool ec0PostEntry = not na(ec0StudyEntryBar) and bar_index > ec0StudyEntryBar

    if na(ec0StudyFastMoverTime) and fastMoverCore
        ec0StudyFastMoverTime := timenow

    if na(ec0StudyLiveBuyTime)
        if aEntryNow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyTime := timenow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyLane := "A"
        else if bEntryNow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyTime := timenow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyLane := "B"
        else if cEntryNow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyTime := timenow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyLane := "C"
        else if dEntryNow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyTime := timenow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyLane := "D"
        else if eEntryNow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyTime := timenow
            ec0StudyLiveBuyLane := "E"

    if ec0PostEntry
        ec0StudyHighest := na(ec0StudyHighest) ? high : math.max(ec0StudyHighest, high)
        ec0StudyLowest  := na(ec0StudyLowest)  ? low  : math.min(ec0StudyLowest, low)

        if not ec0StudyT1Hit and close >= ec0StudyT1
            ec0StudyT1Hit  := true
            ec0StudyT1Time := timenow
        if not ec0StudyT2Hit and close >= ec0StudyT2
            ec0StudyT2Hit  := true
            ec0StudyT2Time := timenow
        if not ec0StudyT3Hit and close >= ec0StudyT3
            ec0StudyT3Hit  := true
            ec0StudyT3Time := timenow

        if not ec0StudyRefStopHit and close <= ec0StudyRefStop
            ec0StudyRefStopHit  := true
            ec0StudyRefStopTime := timenow
        if not ec0StudyStructStopHit and close <= ec0StudyStructStop
            ec0StudyStructStopHit  := true
            ec0StudyStructStopTime := timenow

    bool ec0BothStopsHit = ec0StudyRefStopHit and ec0StudyStructStopHit
    bool ec0FinishT3     = ec0StudyT3Hit
    bool ec0FinishEod    = forceExitNow

    if (ec0BothStopsHit or ec0FinishT3 or ec0FinishEod) and (na(ec0StudyResultEventBar) or ec0StudyResultEventBar != bar_index)
        float ec0MfePct = not na(ec0StudyHighest) and ec0StudyEntry > 0 ? (ec0StudyHighest / ec0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float ec0MaePct = not na(ec0StudyLowest) and ec0StudyEntry > 0 ? (ec0StudyLowest / ec0StudyEntry - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
        float ec0T1Min  = not na(ec0StudyT1Time) and not na(ec0StudyEntryTime) ? (ec0StudyT1Time - ec0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float ec0T2Min  = not na(ec0StudyT2Time) and not na(ec0StudyEntryTime) ? (ec0StudyT2Time - ec0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float ec0T3Min  = not na(ec0StudyT3Time) and not na(ec0StudyEntryTime) ? (ec0StudyT3Time - ec0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float ec0FastMin = not na(ec0StudyFastMoverTime) and not na(ec0StudyEntryTime) ? (ec0StudyFastMoverTime - ec0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na
        float ec0LiveBuyMin = not na(ec0StudyLiveBuyTime) and not na(ec0StudyEntryTime) ? (ec0StudyLiveBuyTime - ec0StudyEntryTime) / 60000.0 : na

        bool ec0T1BeforeRef = ec0StudyT1Hit and (not ec0StudyRefStopHit or ec0StudyT1Time < ec0StudyRefStopTime)
        bool ec0T2BeforeRef = ec0StudyT2Hit and (not ec0StudyRefStopHit or ec0StudyT2Time < ec0StudyRefStopTime)
        bool ec0T3BeforeRef = ec0StudyT3Hit and (not ec0StudyRefStopHit or ec0StudyT3Time < ec0StudyRefStopTime)
        bool ec0T1BeforeStruct = ec0StudyT1Hit and (not ec0StudyStructStopHit or ec0StudyT1Time < ec0StudyStructStopTime)
        bool ec0T2BeforeStruct = ec0StudyT2Hit and (not ec0StudyStructStopHit or ec0StudyT2Time < ec0StudyStructStopTime)
        bool ec0T3BeforeStruct = ec0StudyT3Hit and (not ec0StudyStructStopHit or ec0StudyT3Time < ec0StudyStructStopTime)

        ec0StudyEndReason := ec0FinishT3 ? "+3%" : ec0BothStopsHit ? "BOTH STOPS" : "EOD"
        ec0StudyLastSummary := "End " + ec0StudyEndReason +
             " | Ref +1/+2/+3 " + (ec0T1BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T2BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T3BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") +
             " | Struct +1/+2/+3 " + (ec0T1BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T2BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T3BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N")
        ec0StudyResultEventBar := bar_index
        ec0StudyDone   := true
        ec0StudyActive := false

        if enablePineAlerts and enableEarlyConfirmedResearchAlerts
            alert("NG RESEARCH EC0 RESULT | " + syminfo.ticker +
                  " | Entry " + str.tostring(ec0StudyEntry, format.mintick) +
                  " | RefStop " + str.tostring(ec0StudyRefStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | StructStop " + str.tostring(ec0StudyStructStop, format.mintick) +
                  " | QtyRef " + str.tostring(ec0StudyQtyRef, "#") +
                  " | QtyStruct " + str.tostring(ec0StudyQtyStruct, "#") +
                  " | End " + ec0StudyEndReason +
                  " | RefT1/T2/T3 " + (ec0T1BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T2BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T3BeforeRef ? "Y" : "N") +
                  " | StructT1/T2/T3 " + (ec0T1BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T2BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N") + "/" + (ec0T3BeforeStruct ? "Y" : "N") +
                  " | T1Min " + (na(ec0T1Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0T1Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | T2Min " + (na(ec0T2Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0T2Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | T3Min " + (na(ec0T3Min) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0T3Min, "#.#")) +
                  " | MFE " + (na(ec0MfePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0MfePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | MAE " + (na(ec0MaePct) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0MaePct, "#.##") + "%") +
                  " | FastMoverDelay " + (na(ec0FastMin) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0FastMin, "#.#") + "m") +
                  " | LiveBuy " + ec0StudyLiveBuyLane +
                  " | LiveBuyDelay " + (na(ec0LiveBuyMin) ? "—" : str.tostring(ec0LiveBuyMin, "#.#") + "m") +
                  " | CAtEntry " + ec0StudyCStateAtEntry +
                  actionMeta("RESEARCH_EC0_RESULT", time),
                  alert.freq_all)

// Data-Window-only EC0 levels. They do not occupy chart space.
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyEntry      : na, title="EC0 Study Entry",       color=color.new(color.blue, 100),  display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyRefStop    : na, title="EC0 Study Ref Stop",    color=color.new(color.red, 100),   display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyStructStop : na, title="EC0 Study Struct Stop", color=color.new(color.red, 100),   display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyT1         : na, title="EC0 Study +1%",         color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyT2         : na, title="EC0 Study +2%",         color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)
plot(enableEarlyConfirmedShadowStudy and (ec0StudyActive or ec0StudyDone) ? ec0StudyT3         : na, title="EC0 Study +3%",         color=color.new(color.green, 100), display=display.data_window)

int focusLane = 0
if aEntryNow or aStopNow or aTargetNow or aPartialNow
    focusLane := 1
else if bEntryNow or bStopNowEv or bTargetNowEv or bPartialNow
    focusLane := 2
else if cEntryNow or cStopNowEv or cTargetNowEv or cPartialNow
    focusLane := 3
else if dEntryNow or dStopNowEv or dTargetNowEv or dPartialNow
    focusLane := 4
else if eEntryNow or eStopNowEv or eTargetNowEv or ePartialNow
    focusLane := 5
else if autoState == 3
    focusLane := 1
else if bState == 3
    focusLane := 2
else if cState == 3
    focusLane := 3
else if dState == 3
    focusLane := 4
else if eState == 3
    focusLane := 5
else if autoState == 2
    focusLane := 1
else if bState == 2
    focusLane := 2
else if cState == 2
    focusLane := 3
else if dState == 2
    focusLane := 4
else if eState == 2
    focusLane := 5

focusEntry = focusLane == 1 ? autoEntry : focusLane == 2 ? bEntry : focusLane == 3 ? cEntry : focusLane == 4 ? dEntry : focusLane == 5 ? eEntry : na
focusStop  = focusLane == 1 ? (autoState == 3 and not na(autoManagedStop) ? autoManagedStop : autoStop) :
     focusLane == 2 ? (bState == 3 and not na(bManagedStop) ? bManagedStop : bStop) :
     focusLane == 3 ? (cState == 3 and not na(cManagedStop) ? cManagedStop : cStop) :
     focusLane == 4 ? (dState == 3 and not na(dManagedStop) ? dManagedStop : dStop) :
     focusLane == 5 ? (eState == 3 and not na(eManagedStop) ? eManagedStop : eStop) : na
focusTarget = focusLane == 1 ? autoTarget : focusLane == 2 ? bTarget : focusLane == 3 ? cTarget : focusLane == 4 ? dTarget : focusLane == 5 ? eTarget : na
focusReadyBar = focusLane == 1 ? readyBar : focusLane == 2 ? bReadyBar : focusLane == 3 ? cReadyBar : focusLane == 4 ? dReadyBar : focusLane == 5 ? eReadyBar : na
focusLevelsValid = not na(focusEntry) and not na(focusStop) and focusEntry > focusStop
focusRiskPerShare = focusLane == 1 ? aRiskPerShare : focusLane == 2 ? bRiskPerShare : focusLane == 3 ? cRiskPerShare : focusLane == 4 ? dRiskPerShare : focusLane == 5 ? eRiskPerShare : na
focusPaperQty = focusLane == 1 ? (autoState == 3 and not na(autoRemainingQty) ? autoRemainingQty : aPaperQty) :
     focusLane == 2 ? (bState == 3 and not na(bRemainingQty) ? bRemainingQty : bPaperQty) :
     focusLane == 3 ? (cState == 3 and not na(cRemainingQty) ? cRemainingQty : cPaperQty) :
     focusLane == 4 ? (dState == 3 and not na(dRemainingQty) ? dRemainingQty : dPaperQty) :
     focusLane == 5 ? (eState == 3 and not na(eRemainingQty) ? eRemainingQty : ePaperQty) : na
focusEffectiveRisk = focusLane == 1 ? aEffectiveRisk : focusLane == 2 ? bEffectiveRisk : focusLane == 3 ? cEffectiveRisk : focusLane == 4 ? dEffectiveRisk : focusLane == 5 ? eEffectiveRisk : na

var line entryLine  = na
var line stopLine   = na
var line targetLine = na
geometryActive = showSetupGeometry and focusLevelsValid and focusLane != 0
geometryStartBar = not na(focusReadyBar) ? focusReadyBar : bar_index

if geometryActive
    if na(entryLine)
        entryLine := line.new(geometryStartBar, focusEntry, bar_index + 1, focusEntry, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.lime, width=2)
    else
        line.set_xy1(entryLine, geometryStartBar, focusEntry)
        line.set_xy2(entryLine, bar_index + 1, focusEntry)
    if na(stopLine)
        stopLine := line.new(geometryStartBar, focusStop, bar_index + 1, focusStop, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.red, width=2)
    else
        line.set_xy1(stopLine, geometryStartBar, focusStop)
        line.set_xy2(stopLine, bar_index + 1, focusStop)
    if na(targetLine)
        targetLine := line.new(geometryStartBar, focusTarget, bar_index + 1, focusTarget, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.aqua, width=2)
    else
        line.set_xy1(targetLine, geometryStartBar, focusTarget)
        line.set_xy2(targetLine, bar_index + 1, focusTarget)
else
    if not na(entryLine)
        line.delete(entryLine)
        entryLine := na
    if not na(stopLine)
        line.delete(stopLine)
        stopLine := na
    if not na(targetLine)
        line.delete(targetLine)
        targetLine := na

// Optional research markers. Hidden by default.
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and expansionSignal, title="Lane A expansion", style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.blue, 0), text="A EXP", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and autoState == 2 and bar_index == readyBar, title="Lane A ready", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.yellow, 0), text="A RDY", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and bBreakoutQuality, title="Lane B level breakout", style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.purple, 0), text="B BO", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and bState == 2 and bar_index == bReadyBar, title="Lane B ready", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.fuchsia, 0), text="B RDY", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and cMomentumQuality, title="Lane C momentum setup", style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.teal, 0), text="C MOM", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and cState == 2 and bar_index == cReadyBar, title="Lane C ready", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.aqua, 0), text="C RDY", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and dImpulseQuality, title="Lane D opening drive impulse", style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.orange, 0), text="D IMP", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and dState == 2 and bar_index == dReadyBar, title="Lane D ready", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.orange, 0), text="D RDY", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and ePauseCandidate, title="Lane E late pullback/base", style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.yellow, 0), text="E PB", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and eState == 2 and bar_index == eReadyBar, title="Lane E ready", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.yellow, 0), text="E RDY", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showDebugMarkers and fastWatchNow, title="Fast mover watch", style=shape.diamond, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.tiny, color=color.new(color.yellow, 0), text="WATCH", display=display.pane)

plotshape(showTradeMarkers and aEntryNow, title="Lane A Paper BUY", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.small, color=color.lime, text="BUY A", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and (aStopNow or aTargetNow or aPartialNow), title="Lane A Paper SELL", style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar,
     size=size.small, color=color.red, text="SELL A", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and bEntryNow, title="Lane B Paper BUY", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.small, color=color.lime, text="BUY B", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and (bStopNowEv or bTargetNowEv or bPartialNow), title="Lane B Paper SELL", style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar,
     size=size.small, color=color.red, text="SELL B", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and cEntryNow, title="Lane C Paper BUY", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.small, color=color.lime, text="BUY C", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and (cStopNowEv or cTargetNowEv or cPartialNow), title="Lane C Paper SELL", style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar,
     size=size.small, color=color.red, text="SELL C", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and dEntryNow, title="Lane D Paper BUY", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.small, color=color.lime, text="BUY D", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and (dStopNowEv or dTargetNowEv or dPartialNow), title="Lane D Paper SELL", style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar,
     size=size.small, color=color.red, text="SELL D", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and eEntryNow, title="Lane E Paper BUY", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar,
     size=size.small, color=color.lime, text="BUY E", display=display.pane)
plotshape(showTradeMarkers and (eStopNowEv or eTargetNowEv or ePartialNow), title="Lane E Paper SELL", style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar,
     size=size.small, color=color.red, text="SELL E", display=display.pane)

// Backup named alert conditions for diagnosis.
// Primary production notifications should still use "Any alert() function call"
// so they receive the detailed dynamic Entry/SL/Target/Qty messages above.
alertcondition(aEntryNow or bEntryNow or cEntryNow or dEntryNow or eEntryNow,
     title="NG BACKUP ANY PAPER BUY",
     message="NG BACKUP PAPER BUY event on {{ticker}}")
alertcondition(aStopNow or aTargetNow or aPartialNow or bStopNowEv or bTargetNowEv or bPartialNow or cStopNowEv or cTargetNowEv or cPartialNow or dStopNowEv or dTargetNowEv or dPartialNow or eStopNowEv or eTargetNowEv or ePartialNow,
     title="NG BACKUP ANY PAPER SELL",
     message="NG BACKUP PAPER SELL event on {{ticker}}")

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Compact dashboard
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dashPosition = dashboardPosInput == "Top Left" ? position.top_left :
     dashboardPosInput == "Middle Right" ? position.middle_right :
     dashboardPosInput == "Middle Left" ? position.middle_left :
     dashboardPosInput == "Bottom Right" ? position.bottom_right :
     dashboardPosInput == "Bottom Left" ? position.bottom_left : position.top_right

// 14 rows only. Volume row now shows current pace versus session memory; research diagnostics stay internal.
var table dash = table.new(position.top_right, 2, 14,
     bgcolor=color.new(color.black, 12), frame_color=color.new(color.gray, 55), frame_width=1)

fmtPct(x) => na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(x, "#.##") + "%"
fmtPx(x)  => na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(x, format.mintick)
fmtNum(x) => na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(x, "#.##")

goodBg    = color.new(color.green, 65)
badBg     = color.new(color.red, 70)
warnBg    = color.new(color.orange, 65)
neutralBg = color.new(color.gray, 80)
blueBg    = color.new(color.blue, 65)

string aStage = autoState == 0 ? "SCAN" : autoState == 1 ? "WAIT PB" : autoState == 2 ? "READY" : autoState == 3 ? "TRADE" : autoState == 5 ? "MISS" : "EXIT"
string bStage = bState == 0 ? "SCAN" : bState == 1 ? "WAIT LEVEL" : bState == 2 ? "READY" : bState == 3 ? "TRADE" : bState == 5 ? "MISS" : "EXIT"
string cStage = cState == 0 ? "SCAN" : cState == 2 ? "READY" : cState == 3 ? "TRADE" : cState == 5 ? "MISS" : "EXIT"
string dStage = not enableLaneD ? "OFF" : dState == 0 and not dBeforeEnd ? "OPEN DONE" : dState == 0 ? "SCAN" : dState == 1 ? "WAIT μPB" : dState == 2 ? "READY" : dState == 3 ? "TRADE" : dState == 5 ? "MISS" : "EXIT"
string eStartTxt = str.tostring(D_END_HOUR) + ":" + str.tostring(D_END_MINUTE, "00")
string eStage = not enableLaneE ? "OFF" : not eWindowOpen and eState == 0 ? "AFTER " + eStartTxt : eState == 0 ? "SCAN" : eState == 1 ? "WAIT PB/BASE" : eState == 2 ? "READY" : eState == 3 ? "TRADE" : eState == 5 ? "MISS" : "EXIT"

string focusTxt = focusLane == 1 ? "A" : focusLane == 2 ? "B" : focusLane == 3 ? "C" : focusLane == 4 ? "D" : focusLane == 5 ? "E" : "—"

bool anySellNow = aStopNow or aTargetNow or aPartialNow or bStopNowEv or bTargetNowEv or bPartialNow or cStopNowEv or cTargetNowEv or cPartialNow or dStopNowEv or dTargetNowEv or dPartialNow or eStopNowEv or eTargetNowEv or ePartialNow
bool anyBuyNow  = aEntryNow or bEntryNow or cEntryNow or dEntryNow or eEntryNow
bool anyInTrade = autoState == 3 or bState == 3 or cState == 3 or dState == 3 or eState == 3
bool anyReady   = autoState == 2 or bState == 2 or cState == 2 or dState == 2 or eState == 2
bool anyWaiting = autoState == 1 or bState == 1 or dState == 1 or eState == 1

string contextBlocker = not isFiveMinute ? "USE 5m" :
     not inNseCashSession ? "OUTSIDE SESSION" :
     not afterEntryStart ? "BEFORE START" :
     not beforeEntryCutoff ? "ENTRY CLOSED" :
     not emaTrendUp ? "EMA NOT UP" :
     not aboveVWAP ? "BELOW VWAP" :
     not rsLeader ? "RS <= 0" : "CONTEXT OK"

string aBlocker = autoState != 0 ? aStage :
     not contextGood ? contextBlocker :
     close <= open ? "A: need bull bar" :
     na(priorHigh) or close <= priorHigh ? "A: no 8-bar BO" :
     na(atr) or atr <= 0 or barRange < atr * MIN_EXPANSION_RANGE_ATR ? "A: range <1 ATR" :
     bodyFraction < MIN_EXPANSION_BODY_FRACTION ? "A: body <60%" :
     closePosition < MIN_EXPANSION_CLOSE_POSITION ? "A: weak close" :
     na(completedBarVolRatio) or completedBarVolRatio < MIN_EXPANSION_VOLUME_RATIO ? "A: vol <1.5x" : "A: qualifying"

string cBlocker = cState != 0 ? cStage :
     not contextGood ? contextBlocker :
     na(priorHigh) or close <= priorHigh ? "C: no 8-bar BO" :
     na(atr) or atr <= 0 or barRange < atr * C_MIN_RANGE_ATR ? "C: range <1 ATR" :
     bodyFraction < C_MIN_BODY_FRACTION ? "C: body <65%" :
     closePosition < C_MIN_CLOSE_POSITION ? "C: weak close" :
     na(completedBarVolRatio) or completedBarVolRatio < C_MIN_VOLUME_RATIO ? "C: vol <2x" :
     na(rsSpreadPct) or rsSpreadPct < C_MIN_RS_PCT ? "C: RS <1%" :
     na(cEmaExtensionAtr) or cEmaExtensionAtr > C_MAX_CLOSE_ABOVE_EMA_ATR ? "C: too extended" : "C: qualifying"

string eBlocker = not enableLaneE ? "E OFF" :
     not eWindowOpen ? "E starts " + eStartTxt :
     eState != 0 ? (eState == 1 ? eLastRejectReason : eStage) :
     not sessionVolImpulseOk ? "E: wait session vol impulse" :
     not eContextStrong ? "E: wait price/RS context" : "E: arm PB/base"

// Coverage diagnostics are DISPLAY ONLY. Prefer the finalized remembered C/D
// reason for a recent confirmed attempt so a forming next bar cannot hide why
// the prior momentum bar failed. A uses its actual current state/blocker.
string aCoverageDiag = autoState != 0 ? "A " + aStage : aBlocker
string cCoverageDiag = cState != 0 ? "C " + cStage :
     not na(cLastRejectBar) and bar_index - cLastRejectBar <= 2 ? "C: " + cLastRejectReason : cBlocker
string dCoverageDiag = dState != 0 ? "D " + dStage :
     not na(dLastRejectBar) and bar_index - dLastRejectBar <= 2 ? "D: " + dLastRejectReason : "D SCAN"
string fastCoverageWhy = aCoverageDiag + " | " + cCoverageDiag + " | " + dCoverageDiag

string actionTxt = not isFiveMinute ? "NO TRADE" :
     anySellNow ? "SELL NOW" :
     anyBuyNow ? "BUY NOW" :
     anyInTrade ? "HOLD / MANAGE" :
     not entryWindowOpen ? (not afterEntryStart ? "WAIT START" : "NO NEW TRADE") :
     anyReady ? "WAIT TRIGGER" :
     autoState == 1 ? "WAIT 1ST PB" :
     bState == 1 ? "WAIT LEVEL" :
     dState == 1 ? "WAIT MICRO-PB" :
     eState == 1 ? "WAIT RE-ACCEL" :
     fastMoverCore ? "FAST / SEEK SETUP" :
     "NO BUY"

string whyTxt = anyInTrade ? "Trade managed automatically" :
     eState == 2 ? "E ready: new local break" :
     autoState == 2 ? "A ready: break PB high" :
     bState == 2 ? "B ready: level continuation" :
     cState == 2 ? "C ready: momentum trigger" :
     dState == 2 ? "D ready: micro-PB trigger" :
     eState == 1 ? eBlocker :
     fastMoverCore and eWindowOpen ? "E seeks PB/base | " + cCoverageDiag :
     fastMoverCore ? fastCoverageWhy :
     autoState == 1 ? "A: waiting controlled PB" :
     bState == 1 ? "B: waiting accept/retest" :
     dState == 1 ? "D: waiting micro-PB" :
     cBlocker != "CONTEXT OK" ? cBlocker : aBlocker

color actionBg = anySellNow ? badBg : anyBuyNow ? goodBg : anyInTrade ? goodBg : anyReady ? blueBg : anyWaiting or fastMoverCore ? warnBg : neutralBg

if barstate.islast
    table.set_position(dash, dashPosition)
    table.clear(dash, 0, 0, 1, 13)
    if showDashboard
        bool dayFast = not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_PCT
        bool rsFast = not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct >= FAST_MIN_DAY_RS_PCT
        bool intraFast = not na(rsSpreadPct) and rsSpreadPct >= FAST_MIN_INTRADAY_RS
        bool volFast = not na(fastVolStrength) and fastVolStrength >= FAST_MIN_VOL_PACE
        bool volSession = sessionVolImpulseOk
        string ctxTxt = (emaTrendUp ? "EMA↑" : "EMA×") + " | " + (aboveVWAP ? "VWAP+" : fastVwapOk ? "VWAP~" : "VWAP-") + " | " + (liquidityOk ? "LIQ✓" : "LIQ×")
        color ctxBg = emaTrendUp and aboveVWAP and liquidityOk ? goodBg : neutralBg
        string strengthTxt = "D " + fmtPct(stockDayPct) + " | RS " + fmtPct(dayRsPct) + " | I " + fmtPct(rsSpreadPct)
        color strengthBg = dayFast and rsFast and intraFast ? goodBg : (not na(stockDayPct) and stockDayPct > 0 and not na(dayRsPct) and dayRsPct > 0 ? warnBg : neutralBg)
        string volumeTxt = "Now " + (na(volPace) ? "—" : str.tostring(volPace, "#.##") + "x") + " | MoverPeak " + (na(sessionVolStrength) ? "—" : str.tostring(sessionVolStrength, "#.##") + "x") + (volSession ? " ✓" : "")
        color volumeBg = volSession ? goodBg : (volFast ? warnBg : neutralBg)
        string levelTxt = "PDH " + fmtPx(pdh) + " | PWH " + fmtPx(pwh)
        string tradeTxt = focusLane == 0 ? "—" : focusTxt + "  E " + fmtPx(focusEntry) + "  S " + fmtPx(focusStop)
        string takeTxt = focusLane == 0 ? "—" : str.tostring(rrMultiple, "#.##") + "R " + fmtPx(focusTarget) + " | Q " + (na(focusPaperQty) ? "—" : str.tostring(focusPaperQty, "#"))
        string riskTxt = focusLane == 0 or na(focusEffectiveRisk) ? "₹" + str.tostring(riskBudget, "#") + " max | ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#") + " cap" : "Risk ₹" + str.tostring(focusEffectiveRisk, "#") + " | Cap ₹" + str.tostring(maxPositionValue, "#")

        table.cell(dash, 0, 0, "NG v0.8.14", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=color.new(color.blue, 45), text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 0, "PAPER • ACTION", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=color.new(color.blue, 45), text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 1, "Context", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 1, ctxTxt, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=ctxBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 2, "Strength", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 2, strengthTxt, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=strengthBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 3, "Volume", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 3, volumeTxt, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=volumeBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 4, "Levels", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 4, levelTxt, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 5, "A • 1st PB", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 5, aStage, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 6, "B • Level", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 6, bStage, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 7, "C • Momentum", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 7, cStage, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 8, "D • Open", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 8, dStage, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 9, "E • Re-Accel", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 9, eStage, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=eState == 2 ? blueBg : eState == 1 ? warnBg : neutralBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 10, "ACTION", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=actionBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 10, actionTxt, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=actionBg, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 11, "Trade", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 11, tradeTxt, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 12, "Take / Risk", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 12, focusLane == 0 ? riskTxt : takeTxt + " | " + riskTxt, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 0, 13, "Why", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
        table.cell(dash, 1, 13, whyTxt, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
